{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XvnJoUyVswYRLxqMhqv9gT","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Khanmigo demo try it student chat interaction khanmigo.ai\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Khanmigo as an AI Personal Tutor and Assistant - AVID Open Access\",\"url\":\"https://avidopenaccess.org/resource/khanmigo-as-an-ai-personal-tutor-and-assistant/\"},{\"title\":\"Meet Khanmigo: Khan Academy's AI-powered teaching assistant & tutor\",\"url\":\"https://www.khanmigo.ai/\"},{\"title\":\"Khanmigo for learners: Always-available tutor, powered by AI\",\"url\":\"https://www.khanmigo.ai/learners\"},{\"title\":\"Introducing… Khanmigo!\",\"url\":\"https://support.khanacademy.org/hc/en-us/community/posts/13992414612877-Introducing-Khanmigo\"},{\"title\":\"AI-powered tutor tested as a way to help educators and students | 60 Minutes - CBS News\",\"url\":\"https://www.cbsnews.com/news/khanmigo-ai-powered-tutor-teaching-assistant-tested-at-schools-60-minutes-transcript/\"},{\"title\":\"Khanmigo: Free, AI-powered teacher assistant by Khan Academy\",\"url\":\"https://www.khanmigo.ai/teachers\"},{\"title\":\"Khanmigo in the Classroom: What Teachers Actually Get | NeuralClass\",\"url\":\"https://neuralclass.uk/articles/khanmigo-in-the-classroom-what-teachers-actually-get\"},{\"title\":\"Introducing Khanmigo | Khanmigo for students | Life skills | Khan Academy\",\"url\":\"https://en.khanacademy.org/college-careers-more/khanmigo-for-students/x5443352261243283:introducing-khanmigo\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about Khanmigo:\n\n## What is Khanmigo?\n\nKhanmigo is an AI-powered personal tutor and teaching assistant from trusted education nonprofit Khan Academy. Khanmigo is powered by Chat GPT-4.\n\n## Student Chat Interactions\n\nUnlike other AI tools such as ChatGPT, Khanmigo doesn't just give answers. Instead, with limitless patience, it guides learners to find the answer themselves. This option is a basic chat feature where students and teachers can ask the Khanmigo chatbot nearly anything, and the bot will provide answers to the best of its ability.\n\n## Features for Students\n\nIn the Practice: Middle School Subjects module, the Khanmigo chatbot greets users with this message: \"Ready for a quiz to build your knowledge? It'll be fun! You can try any of these subjects, or you can enter another topic that you're interested in. We'll work together in rounds of ten questions. Feel free to take your time and ask for hints along the way, or if you prefer, ask me to change the questions to multiple choice!\"\n\n## Access and Pricing\n\nKhanmigo has been in broader rollout since 2023 and is now available to students and teachers through Khan Academy's platform at no cost in the U.S.\n\nYou can visit **www.khanmigo.ai** to learn more and explore the platform's capabilities.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TbUD4eAmf2AFiy49C3yZqP","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"e8fe183b-b549-495b-9129-f8d3e0bcd556","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:07:30.298Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción Google/Khan"}
