{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015mhrFyYcjL3Y2iH1mmmusy","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Gemini Guided Learning blog.google screenshots how it works\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Google Gemini gets Guided Learning mode for Students: Here's how it works | Tech News - Business Standard\",\"url\":\"https://www.business-standard.com/technology/tech-news/google-gemini-gets-guided-learning-mode-for-students-how-it-works-125080701210_1.html\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini’s Guided Learning Mode From Google AI: What Educators Need To Know | Tech & Learning\",\"url\":\"https://www.techlearning.com/how-to/geminis-guided-learning-mode-from-google-ai-what-educators-need-to-know\"},{\"title\":\"Design self-guided learning for your career with Gemini | Google Workspace Blog\",\"url\":\"https://workspace.google.com/blog/ai-and-machine-learning/designing-self-guided-learning-for-career-gemini\"},{\"title\":\"Control Alt Achieve: Gemini's Guided Learning - Moving from Answers to Understanding\",\"url\":\"https://www.controlaltachieve.com/2025/08/guided-learning.html\"},{\"title\":\"Guided Learning in Gemini: From answers to understanding\",\"url\":\"https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/education/guided-learning/\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini Guided Learning: How Google’s new AI feature works\",\"url\":\"https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/gemini/guided-learning-google-gemini/\"},{\"title\":\"Unlocking the Power of Google Gemini’s Guided Learning: A New Era in AI-Powered Education - Digital Tech & Productivity Tips\",\"url\":\"https://dtptips.com/unlocking-the-power-of-google-geminis-guided-learning-a-new-era-in-ai-powered-education/\"},{\"title\":\"Google Gemini's Guided Learning feature makes AI actually check if you understand — here's how it works\",\"url\":\"https://www.tomsguide.com/ai/google-gemini/google-geminis-guided-learning-feature-makes-ai-actually-check-if-you-understand-heres-how-it-works\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's information about Google's Gemini Guided Learning:\n\n## What is Guided Learning?\n\nGoogle made a new tool in Gemini called Guided Learning that helps people learn by asking questions and giving step-by-step help, like having a study buddy that uses pictures and quizzes to teach you.\n\n## How It Works\n\nIn learning mode, Gemini won't just give you answers; instead, it will help you learn using the Socratic method and by offering step-by-step guidance and suggestions. Rather than just giving an answer, Guided Learning works a learner through the learning process with questions and multimedia content, adapting to the user's needs.\n\n## Key Features\n\nExpect images, videos, and quizzes in Guided Learning, focusing on the learning process itself. It can generate study guides from uploaded course material, walk you through debugging problematic code, or simply explain something with helpful videos and images.\n\n## Educational Approach\n\nIt is built on LearnLM—a family of AI models trained to educate based on educational science best practices, and was built from the ground up with teaching in mind. Learning science shows that people learn best when they actively engage with information.\n\nThe feature is available in the Gemini app and is designed to foster deeper understanding rather than simply providing quick answers.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TbUD4eAmf2AFiy49C3yZqP","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"a5aeeab3-d7f8-4726-9a1f-8cd326a8f9fe","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:07:31.003Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción Google/Khan"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012jtQztYB3Jbe7U9DKMLT8b","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"NotebookLM featured notebooks public share notebooklm.google.com/notebook\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Use public notebooks and featured notebooks in NotebookLM - NotebookLM Help\",\"url\":\"https://support.google.com/notebooklm/answer/16322204?hl=en&sjid=14299265548586573846-NC\"},{\"title\":\"Google's awesome NotebookLM tool simplifies sharing with this highly requested feature\",\"url\":\"https://www.androidauthority.com/notebooklm-public-sharing-3563789/\"},{\"title\":\"NotebookLM notebooks can now be shared publicly via links\",\"url\":\"https://9to5google.com/2025/06/03/notebooklm-public-links/\"},{\"title\":\"Google Notebook LM\",\"url\":\"https://sites.google.com/view/notebook-lm\"},{\"title\":\"Use public notebooks and featured notebooks in Gemini Notebook - Gemini Notebook Help\",\"url\":\"https://support.google.com/notebooklm/answer/16322204?hl=en\"},{\"title\":\"NotebookLM introduces curated featured notebooks with partners\",\"url\":\"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/google-labs/notebooklm-featured-notebooks/\"},{\"title\":\"NotebookLM is adding a new way to share your own notebooks publicly.\",\"url\":\"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/google-labs/notebooklm-public-notebooks/\"},{\"title\":\"forums.tomsguide.com\",\"url\":\"https://forums.tomsguide.com/threads/google%E2%80%99s-notebooklm-just-got-a-huge-upgrade-%E2%80%94-here%E2%80%99s-why-it-beats-chatgpt-for-team-projects.571140/latest\"},{\"title\":\"NotebookLM Versions Explained: Free, Pro, Enterprise — and the New Public Sharing Feature\",\"url\":\"https://joesabado.substack.com/p/notebooklm-versions-explained-free\"},{\"title\":\"techcrunch.com\",\"url\":\"https://techcrunch.com/?p=3027596\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about NotebookLM's featured notebooks and public sharing features:\n\n## Featured Notebooks\n\nFeatured notebooks are designed to help you engage deeply with curated knowledge on a range of topics, with notebooks pre-loaded with highest quality sources curated by authors, researchers, publications, and nonprofits around the world, covering topics from in-depth scientific explorations to practical travel guides to advice from experts.\n\nThe \"featured notebooks\" tab is only enabled for consumer accounts, while Workspace Enterprise or Education accounts can only access featured notebooks through URLs. You can browse featured notebooks in the \"Featured notebooks\" tab, and as a viewer, you can read the original sources, ask questions about them in chat mode, or consume pre-formatted artifacts like Audio Overviews or Study Guides.\n\nThe initial collection includes notebooks from The Economist, The Atlantic, as well as professors, authors, and even Shakespeare's works.\n\n## Public Sharing\n\nPublic sharing is only enabled for consumer accounts and is currently disabled for Workspace Enterprise or Education accounts. You can make your notebook public and share a link with anyone with a Google account by copying and sharing the link.\n\nViewers won't be able to edit source content, but can still interact with a public notebook by asking questions or exploring generated content, such as audio overviews, FAQs or briefing documents.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TbUD4eAmf2AFiy49C3yZqP","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"b1dfa975-5421-49c1-9fbd-9ca41f2a92cd","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:07:31.149Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción Google/Khan"}
