{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LwKSpCQBqm2D433pZXb6Yb","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Amira Learning demo try Amira reading tutor student interaction screenshot\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Request a Demo | See Amira Learning in Action\",\"url\":\"https://amiralearning.com/request-a-demo\"},{\"title\":\"AI Reading Tutor & Program | Amira\",\"url\":\"https://amiralearning.com/amira-tutor\"},{\"title\":\"Amira Learning | Reading Assessment & Dyslexia Screener | HMH\",\"url\":\"https://www.hmhco.com/programs/amira\"},{\"title\":\"Reading Programs & Solutions for Schools | Amira\",\"url\":\"https://amiralearning.com/amira-reading-suite\"},{\"title\":\"amira learning raises 11m to put its ai powered literacy tutor in post covid classrooms\",\"url\":\"https://techcrunch.com/2021/04/14/amira-learning-raises-11m-to-put-its-ai-powered-literacy-tutor-in-post-covid-classrooms\"},{\"title\":\"Try Claude\",\"url\":\"https://www.anthropic.com/customers/amira\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about Amira Learning's demo and reading tutor:\n\n## Amira Learning Demo\n\nYou can request a personalized walkthrough of Amira's AI-powered reading tutor and assessment tools, which are built to support teachers and help students thrive in developing reading proficiency. The demo can be requested at the Amira Learning website.\n\n## Student Interaction Features\n\nAmira leads students through interactive conversations, encouraging active thinking with AI-guided, Socratic dialogue. It targets fluency, vocabulary, decoding, and comprehension and develops reading skills through consistent, individualized feedback.\n\nAmira listens as students read aloud and responds in real time with individualized instruction and practice, with every interaction grounded in reading science and neuroscience.\n\n## Visual Examples\n\nThe search results reference that screenshots show a story for a kid to read and a cartoon mascot who cheers them on, demonstrating the interactive nature of the student experience with visual feedback and encouragement during reading sessions.\n\nTo see actual screenshots and try the demo yourself, you can visit the Amira Learning website's demo request page or tutoring product page directly.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q2XBKnZToy495pRBT9n7Bd","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"0d7f90f9-9655-4929-8d2d-beed77ce7ef2","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:07:37.644Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción K12 genAI"}
