{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AKf4YScmv284tS2iuntz5o","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"MagicSchool AI help.magicschool.ai Student Rooms screenshots tool demo\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"AI Tools for K-12 Students & Learners | MagicSchool\",\"url\":\"https://www.magicschool.ai/magicstudent\"},{\"title\":\"AI Tool Demo: Building an Effective Tutor With MagicSchool AI | Edutopia\",\"url\":\"https://www.edutopia.org/video/ai-tool-demo-building-an-effective-tutor-with-magicschool-ai/\"},{\"title\":\"AI Training & Professional Development for Educators | MagicSchool\",\"url\":\"https://www.magicschool.ai/professional-development\"},{\"title\":\"Teacher AI Tools & Platform for Educators | MagicSchool\",\"url\":\"https://www.magicschool.ai/magicschool\"},{\"title\":\"New & Improved AI for Students | MagicSchool\",\"url\":\"https://www.magicschool.ai/blog-posts/new-magicstudent-experience\"},{\"title\":\"MagicSchool Review 2026 - K-12 AI Platform\",\"url\":\"https://tooliverse.ai/tools/magicschool\"},{\"title\":\"AI Tool Demo for Teachers: Building an Effective Tutor with MagicSchool AI - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j-fApoXvTU4\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about MagicSchool AI and Student Rooms:\n\n## MagicSchool AI Overview\n\nMagicSchool is trusted by millions of educators across 20,000+ schools and is the AI platform built specifically for K-12, not adapted from consumer tools.\n\n## Student Rooms\n\nTeachers can access the Custom Chatbot tool, customize a bot based on the needs of their particular class, and then create a \"Room\" that houses the chatbot, which their students can join. These are all accessed through teacher-controlled Student Rooms with built-in moderation and visibility.\n\nStudent Room Insights allow teachers to see how students are engaging and spot where extra support can help.\n\n## Recent Updates\n\nThe all-new MagicStudent features intuitive navigation, ready-to-use student rooms, and a powerful tool playground to explore tools before sharing with students. Starter Rooms are pre-built templates that help teachers quickly set up engaging student activities.\n\n## Tool Demos Available\n\nYou can find custom AI tools, Student Rooms, and Collections ready to use today. Tutorials and tool demos are available to support educators' work.\n\nFor more detailed information and specific screenshots of the tools, you can visit help.magicschool.ai directly, which should have comprehensive documentation and video demonstrations.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q2XBKnZToy495pRBT9n7Bd","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"7bfb2a64-3da0-47e0-86fb-a6cb8ff1f2f3","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:07:39.756Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción K12 genAI"}
