{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KbmGWo8nasjgUWKQYeZ6oB","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"SchoolAI Spaces student view demo support.schoolai.com screenshots\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Give Every Student a Personalized Learning Experience | SchoolAI\",\"url\":\"https://schoolai.com/products/spaces\"},{\"title\":\"SAU19 Knowledge Base - Utilizing SchoolAI (Educators)\",\"url\":\"https://support.sau19.org/help/en-us/107-schoolai/374-utilizing-schoolai-educators\"},{\"title\":\"Screenshots and Annotations - SchoolAI Spaces – Personalized Tutors, Lessons, & Activities\",\"url\":\"https://schoolai.com/spaces/screenshots-and-annotations\"},{\"title\":\"SchoolAI Demo | See How Educators Use AI to Teach and Support Students\",\"url\":\"https://schoolai.com/demo\"},{\"title\":\"SchoolAI — AI Built for Education\",\"url\":\"https://schoolai.com/\"},{\"title\":\"Welcome to SchoolAI! - SchoolAI Spaces – Personalized Tutors, Lessons, & Activities\",\"url\":\"https://schoolai.com/spaces/welcome-to-schoolai\"},{\"title\":\"SchoolAI for Students — Personalized Learning\",\"url\":\"https://schoolai.com/students\"},{\"title\":\"Getting started with Spaces | School AI Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://help.schoolai.com/en/articles/10270211-getting-started-with-spaces\"},{\"title\":\"SchoolAI's Spaces\",\"url\":\"https://student.schoolai.com/student-space/\"},{\"title\":\"Getting students into Spaces | School AI Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://help.schoolai.com/en/articles/10280003-getting-students-into-spaces\"}]\n\nI found search results related to SchoolAI Spaces. Here's what I found:\n\n**SchoolAI Spaces Overview:**\nStudents upload their drafts, notes, and projects directly into a Space, where Dot reviews their uploads, asks questions, and coaches them toward stronger work.\n\n**Student Experience:**\nStudents engage with Spaces through text-based interactions, which can include role-playing scenarios, quizzes, or guided discussions with historical figures or fictional characters. Features are designed with universal accessibility standards in mind, including options to change the language or use voice recording responses.\n\n**Getting Started:**\nTo get a sense of how Spaces work from a student perspective, you can go to the Discover library and choose a Space (like \"Chat with Abraham Lincoln\"), select Start preview, and interact with the Space by typing answers to questions as if you were a student.\n\n**Demo and Support:**\nSchoolAI offers free demos to explore classroom-ready tools and see how teachers, coaches, and admins use AI to save time and personalize learning.\n\nThe search also found a specific SchoolAI Spaces resource about screenshots and annotations at schoolai.com/spaces/screenshots-and-annotations, which appears to be a tutorial space for educators to learn about taking and annotating screenshots on MacBooks.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q2XBKnZToy495pRBT9n7Bd","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"43d3b65a-ff47-4970-b1f8-f3701eaebd61","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:07:40.758Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción K12 genAI"}
