{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01U8ZqYjtHi7CfPZq6tMvAgd","type":"tool_result","content":"# Guided Learning UI and Direct Access Links\n\n## Page Load Status\nYes, the page loads successfully. It's a Google Blog post announcing Guided Learning in Gemini, published August 6, 2025.\n\n## Screenshots and Visual Content\nThe page contains one image showing a side-by-side comparison: \"A side by side by Gemini and Guided Learning answering the same physics homework problem, with Guided Learning beginning with a step-by-step breakdown, while Gemini provides information at once.\"\n\nNo GIFs or videos demonstrating the UI in use are embedded in this content.\n\n## Direct Access Links to Guided Learning\nThree gemini.google.com deep links are provided as examples:\n\n1. **Biology exam preparation**: `gemini.google.com/guided-learning?query=I%27m%20a%20freshman%20preparing%20for%20an%20exam%20in%20my%20intro%20to%20Biology%20class.%20Can%20you%20help%20me%20learn%20about%20enzymes?`\n\n2. **Bee populations topic**: `gemini.google.com/guided-learning?query=How%20do%20bees%20support%20our%20food%20systems?`\n\n3. **Photography exploration**: `gemini.google.com/guided-learning?query=I%27m%20passionate%20about%20photography%20and%20want%20to%20learn%20more`\n\nAdditionally, there's a generic educator link: `gemini.google.com/guided-learning?query=`\n\n## Video Content\nNo YouTube URLs are included in this article."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TbUD4eAmf2AFiy49C3yZqP","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"3725e4b2-7eb6-4685-956d-8405b28a25db","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:07:47.192Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción Google/Khan"}
