{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0191K76mLsKYksBdrUV9a4jT","type":"tool_result","content":"# NotebookLM Featured Notebooks: URLs and UI Imagery\n\n## Public Notebook URLs\n\nYes, the page contains eight direct links to actual NotebookLM notebooks:\n\n1. https://notebooklm.google.com/notebook/780a38ee-d0a6-4fb1-b255-aa03c8d67dce\n2. https://notebooklm.google.com/notebook/5881d15d-7b82-4002-8613-df59b6eece4c\n3. https://notebooklm.google.com/notebook/750a23df-fd98-4954-b9c4-71f16c3ee937\n4. https://notebooklm.google.com/notebook/1e5735b3-7868-44e5-927d-ad7f8d69d5ae\n5. https://notebooklm.google.com/notebook/0d5cd576-2583-4835-8848-a5b7b6a97cea\n6. https://notebooklm.google.com/notebook/505ee4b1-ad05-4673-a06b-1ec106c2b940\n7. https://notebooklm.google.com/notebook/19bde485-a9c1-4809-8884-e872b2b67b44\n8. https://notebooklm.google.com/notebook/e4ddc6f8-ada2-4aaa-b9dc-c3ff7c325bf8\n\n## Visual Content\n\nThe page includes one screenshot labeled as \"A digital interface displays 'NotebookLM' with a detailed view of a Shakespeare notebook\" and displays the \"Featured notebooks\" section showcasing various topics including earnings reports and complete plays. The image is served from Google's web storage infrastructure."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TbUD4eAmf2AFiy49C3yZqP","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"f724f9cd-31f4-4cf5-94b2-a6b37a41cd29","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:07:48.384Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción Google/Khan"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Mp6roPW3XQFmAt595jDw5M","type":"tool_result","content":"# Khanmigo Demo & Preview Availability\n\nBased on the provided webpage content, **there is no public demo or interactive sandbox** available without registration.\n\n## What the Page Offers Instead:\n\n**Video Content:**\n- A TED Talk by Sal Khan (2023) featuring Khanmigo in action, with a thumbnail and play button visible on the page\n\n**Sign-Up Links (Registration Required):**\n- Teachers: Free signup for teacher tools\n- Parents/Learners: Paid subscription required (monthly or annual)\n- Districts: Separate partnership inquiry process\n\n## Key Limitation:\n\nThe page states: \"To access Khanmigo as a parent or learner, you must make a monthly or annual payment, be 18 years or older, live in the United States, and have a billing address in the U.S.\"\n\n## Relevant Links from the Page:\n\n- Main signup: `khanacademy.org/khanmigo/checkout`\n- Teacher tools: `khanacademy.org/khanmigo/teacher-tools`\n- Districts partnership: `districts.khanacademy.org/khanmigo`\n- Support/Help: `support.khanacademy.org`\n\n**Bottom line:** Prospective users cannot preview the actual chat interface or student experience without committing to a paid subscription or district partnership."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TbUD4eAmf2AFiy49C3yZqP","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"c860d6e1-41f3-48ab-9dfe-a5388e17563d","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:07:48.570Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción Google/Khan"}
