{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DqDArZfhaeTYopb72jyhE9","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"speak.com blog \"Live Roleplays\" speaking practice screenshots\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Live Roleplays powered by OpenAI Realtime API\",\"url\":\"https://www.speak.com/blog/live-roleplays\"},{\"title\":\"OpenAI backs $78M round for AI language learning startup Speak - SiliconANGLE\",\"url\":\"https://siliconangle.com/2024/12/10/openai-backs-78m-round-ai-language-learning-startup-speak/\"},{\"title\":\"apps.apple.com\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/py/app/language-learning-speak-on/id6463755496?l=en-GB\"},{\"title\":\"apps.apple.com\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/speak-on-ai-language-learning/id6463755496\"},{\"title\":\"Language Learning – Speak On\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/qa/app/ai-language-learning-speak-on/id6463755496\"},{\"title\":\"English Speaking Practice Chat\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/speak-on-%EC%98%81%EC%96%B4%EA%B3%B5%EB%B6%80-%ED%9A%8C%ED%99%94-ai-%EC%B1%97-%EC%BA%90%EB%A6%AD%ED%84%B0-%EC%8A%A4%ED%94%BC%ED%82%B9/id6463755496?l=ru\"},{\"title\":\"Language Learning – Speak On\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/cd/app/language-learning-speak-on/id6463755496\"},{\"title\":\"SPEAKING GROUP\",\"url\":\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/role-play-on-teaching-speaking/56266550\"},{\"title\":\"apps.apple.com\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/ci/app/%EB%A7%81%ED%94%8C%EB%A0%88%EC%9D%B4-%EC%98%81%EC%96%B4%ED%9A%8C%ED%99%94-%EC%8A%A4%ED%94%BC%ED%82%B9-%EC%A6%90%EA%B2%81%EA%B2%8C/id6743768737?l=en-GB\"},{\"title\":\"Speak Stream\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/pl/app/speak-stream/id6742753447\"}]\n\nI found the blog post you're looking for! Speak has been working with OpenAI to test their new Realtime API and introduced Live Roleplays, a new experience that combines Realtime API with Speak's learning engine to enable immersive, life-like speaking practice in a variety of roleplay scenarios.\n\nThe previous conversational experience had limitations because of lag and errors in the speech transcription and synthesis process, but GPT-4o's direct speech-to-speech capabilities with Realtime API fundamentally solves these problems.\n\nThe blog post is available at: https://www.speak.com/blog/live-roleplays\n\nIf you'd like to see the screenshots and additional details about the Live Roleplays feature, you can visit that link directly. The post was published on October 1, 2024.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LaBSiewVueL6XPi1iZuL7Y","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"054241f5-26b6-4f00-a994-7a4e12dbf47b","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:07:51.205Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción adyacentes"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UrzaQ3fdA5hGG8Lj5HpxoX","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"SimConverse demo video simulated patient conversation feedback rubric\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Students Master Patient Assessments with Simulated Preparation | Villanova University\",\"url\":\"https://www.villanova.edu/villanova/nursing/newsevents/archives/SimConverse.html\"},{\"title\":\"JMIR Formative Research - Web-Based AI-Driven Virtual Patient Simulator Versus Actor-Based Simulation for Teaching Consultation Skills: Multicenter Randomized Crossover Study\",\"url\":\"https://formative.jmir.org/2025/1/e71667\"},{\"title\":\"Original Paper Web-Based AI-Driven Virtual Patient Simulator Versus\",\"url\":\"https://formative.jmir.org/2025/1/e71667/PDF\"},{\"title\":\"AI Insider: Helping future doctors communicate empathetically with patients | Inside UNSW\",\"url\":\"https://www.inside.unsw.edu.au/education/ai-insider-helping-future-doctors-communicate-empathetically-patients\"},{\"title\":\"AI as Preparation for Board Exams – A Successful and Enduring Case Study of SimConverse AI in Optometry | HealthySimulation.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.healthysimulation.com/simconverse-ai-communication-training-optometry-board-exams/\"},{\"title\":\"Increase Clinical Training Capacity with SimConverse’s Large-Scale Communication Platform | HealthySimulation.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.healthysimulation.com/simconverse-communication-skills-ai-training/\"},{\"title\":\"Simconverse | HealthySimulation.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.healthysimulation.com/vendors/simconverse/\"},{\"title\":\"SimConverse | Measure\",\"url\":\"https://www.simconverse.com/product/measure\"},{\"title\":\"SimConverse | Control\",\"url\":\"https://www.simconverse.com/product/control\"},{\"title\":\"Simconverse | Home\",\"url\":\"https://www.simconverse.com/\"}]\n\nI found comprehensive information about SimConverse and its feedback rubric system. Here are the key findings:\n\n## SimConverse Overview\n\nSimConverse is a purpose-built web-based artificial intelligence virtual patient simulator platform designed to develop communication skills in health care professionals, allowing students to conduct open virtual health care consultations through fully automated high-fidelity audio conversations in real time using voice recognition.\n\n## Feedback Rubric System\n\nWhen a simulated assessment conversation is complete, SimConverse provides instant, personalized feedback to the student and faculty member, with behavior-specific insights aligned with learning rubrics based on health issues and behaviors.\n\nThe SimConverse rubric system was developed by the company with a multinational group of clinical and educational experts to ensure alignment with best practice marking and feedback.\n\n## Customization and Deployment\n\nThe SimConverse platform allows faculty to develop their own feedback rubrics or use preexisting ones. The SimConverse AI provides a full transcript of the discussion along with an objective and standardized grading of an organization's rubrics including personalized write-ups of what the learner needs to improve.\n\n## Learning Support Features\n\nThe SimConverse platform provides reflection after each exercise utilizing Gibb's Self-Reflective Cycle, which assists learners in connecting their actions and ideas with the goals of the simulation exercise and making improvements for future conversations.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LaBSiewVueL6XPi1iZuL7Y","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"5c5b402b-aced-4e60-a827-e8fa46290fed","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:07:53.200Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción adyacentes"}
