{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01K7YkuLotwxT1hVcLSfUw8e","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Amira Learning YouTube official demo video \"Amira\" student reading aloud tutor session\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"AI Reading Tutor & Program | Amira\",\"url\":\"https://amiralearning.com/amira-tutor\"},{\"title\":\"Amira Learning | Reading Assessment & Dyslexia Screener | HMH\",\"url\":\"https://www.hmhco.com/programs/amira\"},{\"title\":\"Reading Programs & Solutions for Schools | Amira\",\"url\":\"https://amiralearning.com/amira-reading-suite\"},{\"title\":\"Introducing Amira | The AI Learning Agent for Reading Growth | Videos & Movies on Vimeo\",\"url\":\"https://vimeo.com/1131705350\"},{\"title\":\"Amira Learning - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/@amira-learning\"},{\"title\":\"Amira Learning\",\"url\":\"https://amiralearning.com/\"},{\"title\":\"🤖📚 Students use AI Tutor (Amira) to make big reading gains! - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/nZKVnSNV9pY\"},{\"title\":\"amira learning raises 11m to put its ai powered literacy tutor in post covid classrooms\",\"url\":\"https://techcrunch.com/2021/04/14/amira-learning-raises-11m-to-put-its-ai-powered-literacy-tutor-in-post-covid-classrooms\"},{\"title\":\"Video preview\",\"url\":\"https://preply.com/en/tutor/1864097\"}]\n\nI found search results related to Amira Learning, the AI reading tutor platform. Here's what I discovered:\n\nAmira Learning has developed the first intelligent reading assistant that listens to students as they read out loud, assesses mastery, and delivers personalized tutoring to accelerate reading mastery. The company was founded by a team of former engineers and executives from Pearson, IBM, ACT, and Renaissance and built from a foundation of 20 years of research from Carnegie Mellon University.\n\nRegarding how Amira works during tutoring sessions: Amira listens as students read aloud, capturing authentic data, detecting patterns, fluency challenges, comprehension, and skills gaps. She delivers intervention in the moment, while continuously monitoring progress through every tutoring session.\n\nThe search results show that Amira Learning's mission is to help close the 43 million person literacy gap in America by creating personalized and engaging reading experiences for children.\n\nI found references to Amira Learning's YouTube channel and promotional videos, including one on Vimeo titled \"Introducing Amira | The AI Learning Agent for Reading Growth.\" However, the search results don't provide direct links to a specific official demo video showing a complete student reading aloud tutor session on YouTube. You may want to visit the Amira Learning YouTube channel directly at @amira-learning to view their demo videos.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q2XBKnZToy495pRBT9n7Bd","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"2820b3dc-a608-42a2-bb4a-7b9cf5713467","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:07:57.962Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción K12 genAI"}
