{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Wbi9ETjkWdLctw5AL8X6Af","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"support.khanacademy.org Khanmigo \"tutor me\" student chat screenshot article\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Enabling Khanmigo for Students – Khan Academy Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://support.khanacademy.org/hc/en-us/community/posts/14690781571853-Enabling-Khanmigo-for-Students\"},{\"title\":\"Meet Khanmigo: Khan Academy's AI-powered teaching assistant & tutor\",\"url\":\"https://www.khanmigo.ai/\"},{\"title\":\"Khanmigo as an AI Personal Tutor and Assistant - AVID Open Access\",\"url\":\"https://avidopenaccess.org/resource/khanmigo-as-an-ai-personal-tutor-and-assistant/\"},{\"title\":\"What kind of images can I upload to Khanmigo? – Khan Academy Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://support.khanacademy.org/hc/en-us/articles/36868912022541-What-kind-of-images-can-I-upload-to-Khanmigo\"},{\"title\":\"How are administrators alerted to moderated Khanmigo chats? – Khan Academy Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://support.khanacademy.org/hc/en-us/articles/21943797567629-How-are-administrators-alerted-to-moderated-Khanmigo-chats\"},{\"title\":\"Khanmigo for learners: Always-available tutor, powered by AI\",\"url\":\"https://www.khanmigo.ai/learners\"},{\"title\":\"How do I view my students' Khanmigo chat history? – Khan Academy Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://support.khanacademy.org/hc/en-us/articles/15127248640525-How-do-I-view-my-students-Khanmigo-chat-history\"},{\"title\":\"How do I view my child's Khanmigo chat history? – Khan Academy Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://support.khanacademy.org/hc/en-us/articles/14394854880909-How-do-I-view-my-child-s-Khanmigo-chat-history\"}]\n\nI found several results related to Khanmigo from support.khanacademy.org. Here's what the search returned:\n\nThe search results include Khan Academy support articles about Khanmigo, including:\n\n- **\"Tutor Me\" Feature**: Instructions for the Tutor Me activity on Khanmigo, where users can click a paperclip icon in the chat and choose how to upload images (file, URL, or camera).\n\n- **Student Chat History**: Teachers can view their students' Khanmigo chat transcripts by logging into their Teacher account, navigating to the Teacher Dashboard, selecting the Students tab, clicking on a student's name, and then clicking \"Chat History\" under the Khanmigo section.\n\n- **Khanmigo Overview**: Unlike other AI tools such as ChatGPT, Khanmigo doesn't just give answers. Instead, with limitless patience, it guides learners to find the answer themselves.\n\nThe search results included various support articles with screenshots and instructions, though I cannot reproduce the images directly from the results.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TbUD4eAmf2AFiy49C3yZqP","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"50625732-d54d-4719-a87d-6db5d8ffca9e","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:08:03.819Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción Google/Khan"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018d64NrrqsNmgpsiscN6QdU","type":"tool_result","content":"# Gemini Guided Learning UI Screenshots & Media\n\n## Page Load Status\nYes, the page loads successfully.\n\n## Screenshots & Embedded Media\n\n**Screenshot 1: Study Plan Interface**\n- **Alt Text:** \"A screenshot of a Gemini chat with Guided Learning Mode turned on. The user asks for help learning conjugations for a Spanish course, and the response talks about the lesson topic and then suggests a study path. It finishes by asking, Ready to start with the regular -ar verbs?\"\n- **Caption:** \"In 'Guided Learning' mode, Gemini can lay out a study plan for a topic before walking you through each step — always checking in to see if you're picking things up along the way.\"\n- This shows the interface where Gemini proposes a structured lesson path and initiates interactive instruction.\n\n**Illustration: Learning Environment**\n- **Alt Text:** \"Illustration of a person with a laptop, smiling while taking notes with a pen. Floating elements suggest a learning environment: an audio/video player, a search box, a data chart, and an open book icon.\"\n- This is a conceptual graphic representing the feature's capabilities.\n\n## YouTube Links\nNo specific YouTube URLs are provided in the page content. The article mentions that \"Guided Learning pulls from a database of high-quality diagrams and images and finds relevant videos on YouTube,\" but doesn't include direct links.\n\n## Key UI Capabilities Mentioned\nThe interface supports quizzes, study guides, flashcards, charts, graphs, videos, diagrams, and interactive guidance through conversational chat."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TbUD4eAmf2AFiy49C3yZqP","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"65d57fa3-aa23-406d-a1e5-bf991df3c1e4","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:08:04.263Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción Google/Khan"}
