{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RgsXXZn9sYTQPDwNa4Tbtq","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"help.magicschool.ai \"Student Rooms\" article how students join room\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"MagicSchool AI for Students: Transform Learning with AI Rooms\",\"url\":\"https://www.toolify.ai/ai-news/magicschool-ai-for-students-transform-learning-with-ai-rooms-3394181\"},{\"title\":\"Control Alt Achieve: \\\"Abracadabr-AI\\\" - MagicSchool AI Rooms for Student Learning\",\"url\":\"https://www.controlaltachieve.com/2025/01/abracadabr-ai-magicschool-ai-rooms-for.html\"},{\"title\":\"New & Improved AI for Students | MagicSchool\",\"url\":\"https://www.magicschool.ai/blog-posts/new-magicstudent-experience\"},{\"title\":\"MagicSchool Pricing & Plans | MagicSchool\",\"url\":\"https://www.magicschool.ai/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"3 Ways to Use MagicSchool to Support English Language Learners\",\"url\":\"https://www.edutopia.org/article/using-magicschool-support-english-language-learners/\"},{\"title\":\"What is MagicSchool? How to Use It to Teach | Tech & Learning\",\"url\":\"https://www.techlearning.com/how-to/magicschool-how-to-use-it-to-teach\"},{\"title\":\"AI Integrations for Schools and Districts | MagicSchool\",\"url\":\"https://www.magicschool.ai/integrations\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about how students join MagicSchool rooms. Here's what I found:\n\nThere are multiple ways students can join a room: via a Join URL that allows direct access, through a Google Classroom assignment with the room information, or using Join Codes that can be shared with students or displayed as a QR code.\n\nAdditionally, teachers can easily share their student room by copying the share link and adding it to their learning management system.\n\nHowever, I should note that the search results don't appear to include content specifically from the help.magicschool.ai domain that you requested. The information above comes from educational blogs and articles about MagicSchool. For the official help article from MagicSchool's support site, I recommend visiting help.magicschool.ai directly to access their documentation on this topic.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q2XBKnZToy495pRBT9n7Bd","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"0edbc15d-ab5d-4983-bb1b-c371638bc264","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:08:14.831Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción K12 genAI"}
