{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LEFGG2YeGq5zuGghsJWGzG","type":"tool_result","content":"# TED Talk Page Analysis\n\n**Page Load & Details:**\nYes, the page loads successfully. The exact title is \"How AI could save (not destroy) education\" and the speaker is Sal Khan, founder and CEO of Khan Academy, presented at TED2023 in April 2023.\n\n**Khanmigo Demo Mention:**\nThe description does reference a live demonstration. It states he \"demos some exciting new features for their educational chatbot, Khanmigo.\"\n\n**Transcript Timestamps:**\nThe content provided does not include transcript timestamps or specific moments where the tutor demonstration occurs. The page excerpt shows only the metadata, navigation elements, and talk description—not the full transcript with timing markers.\n\nTo find exact demo timestamps, you would need to access the full transcript on TED.com, which typically appears below the video player on the full talk page."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TbUD4eAmf2AFiy49C3yZqP","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"e4d8f211-6fb5-48a2-9634-b2d22bc7cc76","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:08:18.760Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción Google/Khan"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SFofEBNoMAdPvC2zsRiZiK","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"help.schoolai.com \"Mission Control\" OR \"student experience\" article screenshots dashboard\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"AI progress monitoring to boost student outcomes | SchoolAI\",\"url\":\"https://schoolai.com/blog/ai-progress-monitoring-boost-student-outcomes\"},{\"title\":\"SchoolAI Mission Control | See and Support Students and Teachers Across Your School\",\"url\":\"https://schoolai.com/products/mission-control\"},{\"title\":\"Monitor student activity with Mission Control | School AI Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://help.schoolai.com/en/articles/10270403-monitor-student-activity-with-mission-control\"},{\"title\":\"Getting Started with Spaces | School AI Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://help.schoolai.com/en/articles/15538519-getting-started-with-spaces\"},{\"title\":\"SchoolAI — AI Built for Education\",\"url\":\"https://schoolai.com/\"},{\"title\":\"Create and use Spaces with the Space creator | School AI Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://help.schoolai.com/en/articles/10270295-create-and-use-spaces-with-the-space-creator\"},{\"title\":\"Give Every Student a Personalized Learning Experience | SchoolAI\",\"url\":\"https://schoolai.com/products/spaces\"},{\"title\":\"SchoolAI Review 2026: Student-Safe AI Chat Spaces\",\"url\":\"https://aitoolsbakery.com/blog/schoolai-review/\"},{\"title\":\"The Student Portal: An Overview | School AI Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://help.schoolai.com/en/articles/15138776-the-student-portal-an-overview\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found relevant information about SchoolAI's Mission Control dashboard. Here's what I discovered:\n\n## Mission Control Dashboard Overview\n\nMission Control is your real-time dashboard for monitoring student engagement in Spaces. It provides an overview of all student activity, including real-time insights to instantly see how students interact with the material, including their sentiment and understanding of learning outcomes, data-driven decisions based on live feed of data and trends in student performance, personalized support using smart groups to identify students who need extra help or more challenges, and streamlined monitoring to track all student activity in one place.\n\n## Key Features\n\nYou'll see engagement levels, learning progress, sentiment signals, and alerts if a student gets stuck or says something that needs your attention. Additionally, on the right side panel, you'll get synthesized insights about each participant, and SchoolAI communicates what's important about the student's conversation by giving you a summary and flagging concerning behavior.\n\n## After-Session Insights\n\nAfter a session, Mission Control summarizes each student's strengths and gaps, then groups the class by what they actually demonstrated.\n\nThe search results include articles from help.schoolai.com, the SchoolAI blog, and related help documentation that discuss the Mission Control dashboard and its features for monitoring student experience.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q2XBKnZToy495pRBT9n7Bd","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"558d3ddb-67c2-4b69-a0f1-fbbc96d7628c","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:08:18.938Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción K12 genAI"}
