{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WPpg4JtENKUZM1f6GRMduy","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Khan Academy YouTube official Khanmigo demo video \"Tutor Me\" student walkthrough\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"NEW! Khan Academy's AI Tutor, Khanmigo - In Depth Demo - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rnIgnS8Susg\"},{\"title\":\"Meet Khanmigo: The student tutor AI being tested in school districts | 60 Minutes - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ia3CPhVkUtg\"},{\"title\":\"Introducing Khanmigo | Khanmigo for students | Life skills | Khan Academy\",\"url\":\"https://en.khanacademy.org/college-careers-more/khanmigo-for-students/x5443352261243283:introducing-khanmigo\"},{\"title\":\"Khanmigo for Teachers - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PInbNdxH39w\"},{\"title\":\"Khanmigo as a student tutor and teacher assistant (video)\",\"url\":\"https://www.khanacademy.org/khan-for-educators/k4e-us-demo/xb78db74671c953a7:get-to-know-khan-academy/xb78db74671c953a7:welcome-to-khan-academy-1/v/khanmigo-as-a-student-tutor-and-teacher-assistant\"},{\"title\":\"Khanmigo is now available to the public (US only)| Personalized AI tutor & teaching assistant - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9JreE4HmtNA\"},{\"title\":\"How to communicate with Khanmigo | Introducing Khanmigo | Khanmigo for students | Khan Academy - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JSlCcHrDqNw\"},{\"title\":\"GPT-4o (Omni) math tutoring demo on Khan Academy\",\"url\":\"https://en.khanacademy.org/college-careers-more/khanmigo-for-students/x5443352261243283:introducing-khanmigo/x5443352261243283:learning-with-khanmigo/v/khanmigo-for-students-how-to-use-math-or-science-tutoring-on-khanmigo\"},{\"title\":\"My First Experience with Khanmigo - Khan Academy's Free AI Assistant for Teachers! - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EJcojzVAenk\"},{\"title\":\"Khanmigo Teacher Tools\",\"url\":\"https://ai.uta.edu/?p=2160\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found several Khan Academy YouTube videos related to Khanmigo. Here are the most relevant ones:\n\n1. **NEW! Khan Academy's AI Tutor, Khanmigo - In Depth Demo** - This video from March 14, 2023, features Sal Khan walking through Khan Academy's new AI-powered tutor, Khanmigo. The URL is https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rnIgnS8Susg\n\n2. **How to communicate with Khanmigo** - Posted April 12, 2024, this appears to be a student-focused instructional video at https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JSlCcHrDqNw\n\n3. **Khanmigo for students demo** - There's also content at https://en.khanacademy.org/college-careers-more/khanmigo-for-students/x5443352261243283:introducing-khanmigo that helps students get the most out of their conversations with the AI tutor.\n\nThe search results show that Khan Academy has created multiple demo and walkthrough videos for Khanmigo aimed at both students and teachers. The most comprehensive in-depth demo appears to be Sal Khan's walkthrough video from March 2023.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TbUD4eAmf2AFiy49C3yZqP","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"572aff0a-3d5a-47ad-8929-b7bea0eab641","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:08:22.934Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción Google/Khan"}
