{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Vq5vHJES8sqkhkhk97hqBc","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"blog.duolingo.com birdbrain AI lesson difficulty\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"How Duolingo Uses AI (and Guilt) to Keep You Learning a Language. | by Smyekh | Medium\",\"url\":\"https://medium.com/@Smyekh/how-duolingo-uses-ai-and-guilt-to-keep-you-learning-a-language-6ac3e11b3e44\"},{\"title\":\"Duolingo's AI Strategy Fuels 51% User Growth and $1B Revenue - CAIO_Blog2025\",\"url\":\"https://www.chiefaiofficer.com/blog/duolingos-ai-strategy-fuels-51-user-growth-and-1b-revenue/\"},{\"title\":\"How Duolingo uses AI to create lessons faster\",\"url\":\"https://blog.duolingo.com/large-language-model-duolingo-lessons/\"},{\"title\":\"Uncovering the AI Behind Duolingo: Birdbrain, the Personalization Powerhouse — TOM DACCORD\",\"url\":\"https://www.tomdaccord.com/blog/ai-and-duolingo\"},{\"title\":\"AI at Duolingo: Transforming Language Learning\",\"url\":\"https://angelinepoitout.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/AI-at-Duolingo-Transforming-Language-Learning-1-1.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"How Duolingo Use Ai: Making Language Learning Smarter\",\"url\":\"https://duolingoguides.com/how-duolingo-use-ai/\"},{\"title\":\"Duolingo AI Personalization: How Birdbrain Works\",\"url\":\"https://www.buildmvpfast.com/blog/ai-learning-personalization-duolingo-ai-driven-lessons-2026\"},{\"title\":\"How Duolingo’s AI Learns What You Need to Learn\",\"url\":\"https://spectrum.ieee.org/duolingo\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about Duolingo's BirdBrain AI and lesson difficulty:\n\n## BirdBrain AI System\n\nDuolingo uses an AI model called \"Birdbrain\" to make sure the exercises you see on Duolingo are at the perfect difficulty level based on your strengths and weaknesses.\n\n## How It Adjusts Lesson Difficulty\n\nBirdBrain analyzes over 500 million lessons daily to track user progress and adjust difficulty in real time. BirdBrain estimates the difficulty of each exercise by calculating the difficulty of its various components and when a learner gets an exercise wrong, BirdBrain lowers the estimate of the user's ability and raises the estimate of the exercise's difficulty.\n\nBirdBrain orchestrates personalized pathways by increasing challenge when users excel and offering remediation when they struggle, maintaining a \"flow state\" where tasks are neither too easy nor too hard.\n\n## Performance Scale\n\nDuolingo's Birdbrain AI processes 1.25 billion exercises daily, calibrating difficulty for each learner in 14 milliseconds.\n\nThe search results show that BirdBrain is the core AI system behind Duolingo's personalized learning approach, dynamically adjusting exercise difficulty based on individual learner performance and preferences.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LaBSiewVueL6XPi1iZuL7Y","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"62e2344f-1cb7-4562-a988-48ee4dec4621","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:08:25.870Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción adyacentes"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ALZWbdahvaJDe9YqXZjtXU","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"SimConverse youtube demo \"simconverse\" video patient simulation\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Unlocking Communication Potential: How AI is Revolutionizing Healthcare Training with Will Pamment – Health Podcast Network\",\"url\":\"https://healthpodcastnetwork.com/episodes/heartline/unlocking-communication-potential-how-ai-is-revolutionizing-healthcare-training-with-will-pamment/\"},{\"title\":\"SimConverse on LinkedIn: Leverage AI for Large Scale Healthcare Communication Skills Training\",\"url\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/simconverse_leverage-ai-for-large-scale-healthcare-communication-activity-7077315734388801536-uyjA\"},{\"title\":\"SimConverse | HealthySimulation.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.healthysimulation.com/category/featured/simconverse/\"},{\"title\":\"SimConverse - IMSH 2026 Healthcare Simulation Vendor Showcase from HealthySimulation.com - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=emxyYTAktTc\"},{\"title\":\"SimConverse | Control\",\"url\":\"https://www.simconverse.com/product/control\"},{\"title\":\"Simconverse | HealthySimulation.com\",\"url\":\"https://healthysimulation.com/simconverse\"},{\"title\":\"Simconverse | Home\",\"url\":\"https://www.simconverse.com/\"},{\"title\":\"SimVS | Tablet-Based Clinical Simulation Platform\",\"url\":\"https://www.simvs.com/\"},{\"title\":\"SimConverse - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/@SimConverse\"},{\"title\":\"Video Library | SimVS Learn\",\"url\":\"https://www.simvs.com/learn/videos\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about SimConverse and its video demonstrations:\n\nSimConverse is a simulation platform that uses generative AI to play the role of any patient, colleague or casualty. SimConverse is revolutionizing medical training through advanced conversational simulations, enabling healthcare professionals to enhance their communication skills with patients.\n\nRegarding the demo videos: The platform simulates 'real' conversations between a healthcare professional and a patient, allowing the user to speak to a virtual patient, discover their symptoms, medical history and lifestyle.\n\nThere is a YouTube video available: HealthySimulation.com showcases SimConverse at IMSH 2026, and SimConverse provides global communication skills training for healthcare professionals by leveraging their purpose-built Generative AI. The platform also has its own YouTube channel (@SimConverse) where you can find video demonstrations.\n\nSimConverse was designed to operate within a simulated environment that is safe, repeatable, reflective, and customizable, with scenarios accessible from any device by any learner from any location with their mobile or PC cloud applications.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LaBSiewVueL6XPi1iZuL7Y","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"81de26ed-8c6d-46bb-ab58-67f21faef9dd","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:08:26.352Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción adyacentes"}
