{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WXcwVpyvBfWKXB78VgBdPk","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Amira Learning support help center zendesk \"support.amiralearning\" OR \"help.amiralearning\" screenshots\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"What's new in Amira? | Amira Learning Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://support.amiralearning.com/en/articles/5371876-what-s-new-in-amira\"},{\"title\":\"Customer Support | Help Center for Amira Learning\",\"url\":\"https://amiralearning.com/support\"},{\"title\":\"Support | Amira\",\"url\":\"https://amiralearning.com/support-confirmation\"},{\"title\":\"Updating screenshots in Zendesk – Zendesk help\",\"url\":\"https://support.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/community/posts/5514255960858-Updating-screenshots-in-Zendesk\"},{\"title\":\"Amira Learning Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://support.amiralearning.com/en/\"},{\"title\":\"Tech Support and Troubleshooting | Amira Learning Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://support.amiralearning.com/en/collections/2991090-tech-support-and-troubleshooting\"},{\"title\":\"AmiraLearning.com AMIRA HELP CENTER From the Dashboard Amira Chatbot:\",\"url\":\"https://go.amiralearning.com/hubfs/Classroom%20Resources/Accessing%20Amira%20Support.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Amira (software)\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amira_(software)\"},{\"title\":\"Out-of-the-box support for Zendesk Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://helpx.adobe.com/mena_ar/robohelp/tutorials/zendesk-support-video.html\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about Amira Learning's support resources:\n\nAmira Learning has a customer support center offering FAQs, technical guidance, and how-to support, with contact available by email at support@amiralearning.com. \n\nTeachers can get support through the Amira Help Center, Teacher Resource Hub, or Educator Academy, where they'll find how-to articles, videos, and guides. Live support and in-platform tips are also available.\n\nThe search results confirm that Amira Learning operates a support help center at support.amiralearning.com. The help center contains documentation with screenshots, as evidenced by articles discussing various features with visual references to screenshots showing different settings and options.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q2XBKnZToy495pRBT9n7Bd","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"7a900118-578b-4e28-8527-d26f9e198f7c","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:08:33.585Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción K12 genAI"}
