{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01La3T8561B6BxiWdsbgRYGv","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"magicschool\" site:help.magicschool.ai student rooms\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"AI Tools for K-12 Students & Learners | MagicSchool\",\"url\":\"https://www.magicschool.ai/magicstudent\"},{\"title\":\"Control Alt Achieve: \\\"Abracadabr-AI\\\" - MagicSchool AI Rooms for Student Learning\",\"url\":\"https://www.controlaltachieve.com/2025/01/abracadabr-ai-magicschool-ai-rooms-for.html\"},{\"title\":\"MagicSchool Pricing & Plans | MagicSchool\",\"url\":\"https://www.magicschool.ai/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"New & Improved AI for Students | MagicSchool\",\"url\":\"https://www.magicschool.ai/blog-posts/new-magicstudent-experience\"},{\"title\":\"AI Platform for School Districts | MagicSchool\",\"url\":\"https://www.magicschool.ai/\"},{\"title\":\"MagicSchool Review 2026 - K-12 AI Platform\",\"url\":\"https://tooliverse.ai/tools/magicschool\"},{\"title\":\"Teacher AI Tools & Platform for Educators | MagicSchool\",\"url\":\"https://www.magicschool.ai/magicschool\"}]\n\nI've completed the web search for \"magicschool\" site:help.magicschool.ai student rooms. Here are the key findings:\n\n## Student Rooms Overview\n\nEducators can create school-safe student-friendly \"rooms\" with customized AI chatbots that students can interact with, including chatbots for writing feedback, idea generation, tutoring, sentence starters, character chats, and many more.\n\n## Key Features\n\nMagicSchool records everything typed by the student and the AI so you can review it and learn how best to support your learners.\n\nStarter Rooms are pre-built templates that help teachers quickly set up engaging student activities.\n\n## Setup Process\n\nTo begin setting up a student room, click \"Launch to Students\" from the main MagicSchool screen. Click \"Launch New Room\" to begin setting up a new student room, then hover above any tool and click \"Add\" to add that tool to your student room.\n\nThe search results provided information from the main MagicSchool website and related resources, though specific documentation from help.magicschool.ai wasn't directly returned in the results.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q2XBKnZToy495pRBT9n7Bd","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"9ecff80f-7b9d-4e17-ac48-066314e52d56","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:08:36.063Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción K12 genAI"}
