{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XTkjG25MaJh1QBWVSZu1Sq","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"site:blog.duolingo.com birdbrain\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Learning how to help you learn: Introducing Birdbrain!\",\"url\":\"https://blog.duolingo.com/learning-how-to-help-you-learn-introducing-birdbrain/\"},{\"title\":\"Duolingo’s Biggest Technology Innovations\",\"url\":\"https://blog.duolingo.com/duolingo-technology-innovations/\"},{\"title\":\"Cómo usa Duolingo la IA para crear lecciones más rápido\",\"url\":\"https://blog.duolingo.com/es/como-duolingo-usa-la-ia-para-crear-lecciones-mas-rapido/\"},{\"title\":\"Inside Engineering at Duolingo\",\"url\":\"https://blog.duolingo.com/unique-engineering-problems/\"},{\"title\":\"Birdbrain\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Birdbrain\"},{\"title\":\"4 Learnings from Duolingo Efficacy Studies\",\"url\":\"https://blog.duolingo.com/results-duolingo-efficacy-studies/\"},{\"title\":\"How Duolingo uses AI to create lessons faster\",\"url\":\"https://blog.duolingo.com/large-language-model-duolingo-lessons/\"},{\"title\":\"En Duolingo, los expertos y la IA trabajan en conjunto para crear una experiencia de aprendizaje de primera\",\"url\":\"https://blog.duolingo.com/es/inteligencia-artificial-duolingo/\"},{\"title\":\"Does Duolingo Work for Learning a Language?\",\"url\":\"https://blog.duolingo.com/how-well-does-duolingo-work/\"},{\"title\":\"At Duolingo, humans and AI work together to create a high-quality learning experience\",\"url\":\"https://blog.duolingo.com/how-duolingo-experts-work-with-ai/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results from the Duolingo blog, here's what I found about Birdbrain:\n\nDuolingo developed a machine learning model called \"Birdbrain\" which learns both from and about you in order to help you learn. Birdbrain continuously studies how much learners know and the difficulty level of different language material, making an educated guess about whether a learner will get a given exercise right.\n\nIn most cases, Duolingo uses the Birdbrain model to figure out which exercises in a particular lesson are going to be the best match for a learner's level of knowledge. The system uses data from more than 500 million exercises completed daily on Duolingo to learn both how proficient learners are and how difficult the content is for each of them.\n\nBirdbrain has resulted in an improved learning experience for learners by providing more tailored lessons at exactly their learning level.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LaBSiewVueL6XPi1iZuL7Y","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"7ca59399-b3ee-42a8-b6d3-e7114c24d662","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:08:41.455Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción adyacentes"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ejyry71yAC9FYfj6sED3dY","type":"tool_result","content":"# Gemini Notebook Help Article Analysis\n\n**Does it load?** Yes, the help article loads successfully.\n\n**Title:** \"Use public notebooks and featured notebooks in Gemini Notebook\"\n\n**Screenshots:** No screenshots of the NotebookLM UI are included in this help article. There are no images of open notebooks, chat interfaces, or the featured notebooks tab.\n\n**Google account requirement:** The article states that you can \"share a link with anyone with a Google account\" for public notebooks, indicating viewers need Google accounts. For featured notebooks, it notes they are \"only enabled for consumer accounts,\" suggesting account access is necessary, though the article doesn't explicitly state whether sign-in is mandatory for viewing featured notebooks accessed via direct URL."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TbUD4eAmf2AFiy49C3yZqP","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"bf34579d-c316-4141-ae35-7638ed540af2","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:08:42.915Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción Google/Khan"}
