{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NnRRhmU4RV84SEcZGXHvcY","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"YouTube Google official video \"Guided Learning\" Gemini demo watch\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Guided Learning in Google Gemini - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MIbpghu8BIY\"},{\"title\":\"Advancing the frontier of video understanding with Gemini 2.5 - Google Developers Blog\",\"url\":\"https://developers.googleblog.com/gemini-2-5-video-understanding/\"},{\"title\":\"How to Use Gemini's GUIDED LEARNING Like Being Taught by a Teacher - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J2DGNThIA2M\"},{\"title\":\"The capabilities of multimodal AI | Gemini Demo - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UIZAiXYceBI\"},{\"title\":\"GOOGLE GEMINI'S NEW GUIDED LEARNING - A GAME CHANGER FOR LEARNING! - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4ErM2corKFQ\"},{\"title\":\"Guided Learning with Gemini: Your Google AI Study Partner - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Au9keVBPrcc\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini for Education: The Complete Tutorial Series - The Google for Education Community Platform\",\"url\":\"https://www.googleforeducommunity.com/t5/Gemini-Space/Gemini-for-Education-The-Complete-Tutorial-Series/m-p/198573\"},{\"title\":\"Transform education with Gemini for Google Workspace - in depth demos - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLP7Bvyb3ap462hNhU9dZdFEu3H04Efbyf\"},{\"title\":\"Ranga's Take on Gemini Guided Learning\",\"url\":\"https://rangaedu.substack.com/p/rangas-take-on-gemini-guided-learning\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found several videos related to Google Gemini's Guided Learning feature:\n\n**Official Google Video:**\nThe main video exploring the \"Guided Learning\" feature in Google Gemini shows how it works a learner through the learning process rather than just giving an answer. You can watch it here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MIbpghu8BIY (published August 8, 2025)\n\n**Additional Related Videos:**\nThere are also several other YouTube videos about Gemini's Guided Learning feature:\n- \"How to Use Gemini's GUIDED LEARNING Like Being Taught by a Teacher\" - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J2DGNThIA2M\n- \"The capabilities of multimodal AI | Gemini Demo\" - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UIZAiXYceBI (an official Google demonstration)\n- \"GOOGLE GEMINI'S NEW GUIDED LEARNING - A GAME CHANGER FOR LEARNING!\" - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4ErM2corKFQ\n\nThe first link appears to be the official Google video specifically demonstrating the Guided Learning feature in Gemini.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TbUD4eAmf2AFiy49C3yZqP","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"346ce096-8e8a-4367-b29b-bbb12321c350","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:08:46.049Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción Google/Khan"}
