{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019QSLgAWDMHVQyDUwVTewbT","type":"tool_result","content":"# Duolingo Birdbrain Blog Post Analysis\n\n**Does it load as a real Duolingo blog post?**\nYes, this appears to be an authentic Duolingo blog post published October 7, 2020, authored by Klinton Bicknell and Claire Brust (both Ph.D.s).\n\n**Does it contain screenshots of actual Duolingo lesson UI?**\nNo. The page includes illustrations and diagrams, but not genuine screenshots of learners completing exercises or actual session interfaces.\n\n**Images with alt text/captions:**\n\n1. \"Illustration of a green silhouette of Duo the owl with his brain outlined inside in green, next to the word 'Birdbrain'\"\n\n2. \"What does Birdbrain do?\" – Shows a lesson exercise image labeled \"exercise\" and learner image labeled \"Zari,\" with Duo's brain outlined below, captioned \"predicts personalized difficulty level\"\n\n3. Duo owl illustration \"holding a magic hat and a magic wand and watching a mobile phone with a Duolingo lesson jump out of the hat\"\n\n4. Graph showing \"percent of lessons personalized\" over time, displaying growth from 0% to over 20% between March-October 2020\n\n**Does it require login?**\nNo login requirement is indicated in the content provided."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LaBSiewVueL6XPi1iZuL7Y","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"406f5941-7757-43eb-ac87-4fcceac1dcc6","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:08:52.333Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción adyacentes"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016FQ43GAAn8DKCGXx9pHeTS","type":"tool_result","content":"# MagicSchool Help Center Collections\n\nBased on the homepage, here are the main collections that would likely contain UI screenshots and guidance:\n\n**Student Rooms & Related:**\n- \"Student Rooms & Teacher Tools\" (22 articles) covers \"student rooms, co-teachers, and engagement insights\"\n- \"About Student Room Templates\" (5 articles) explains \"how Student Room Templates work\" and features \"pre-made Student Room Templates\"\n\n**Platform & Tools:**\n- \"Platform Features & Customization\" (58 articles) helps users \"manage features, customize tools, and optimize your experience\"\n- \"Resources & Training\" (52 articles) offers \"free resources to level up your AI knowledge and MagicSchool skills\"\n\n**Technical Guidance:**\n- \"Tech Support & Troubleshooting\" (20 articles) addresses \"exports, cache clearing, formatting issues, and account settings\"\n\n**Additional Resources:**\n- \"Adobe Image Generator Support\" (7 articles) provides guidance on various technical matters\n- \"District Admin Resources\" (4 articles) assists administrative teams with implementation\n\nThe collections with the highest article counts (Platform Features & Resources/Training) would most likely contain detailed UI screenshots and visual walkthroughs."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q2XBKnZToy495pRBT9n7Bd","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"35334c18-fca7-40c4-b90e-0df12f76e40c","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:08:53.186Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción K12 genAI"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016mSCw5yh69cWKhgTi6oAx2","type":"tool_result","content":"# SimConverse Homepage Media Analysis\n\nBased on the provided webpage content, **there are no embedded videos, product screenshots, or demo links visible**.\n\n## Key Findings:\n\n**Video Embeds:** None detected. No YouTube or Vimeo URLs are present in the HTML structure.\n\n**Product Screenshots:** No images showing learners interacting with simulated patients, transcripts, or rubric feedback are included in the content.\n\n**Demo Access:**\n- A \"Book a demo\" call-to-action button appears multiple times throughout the page\n- However, no direct \"watch demo\" video link or public demonstration URL is provided\n- The booking flow leads to a form (\"Thanks for booking!\") rather than a video preview\n\n**Visual Content Present:**\nThe page does include institutional logos (universities, NHS organizations, etc.) and mentions \"photorealistic avatars\" and \"unlimited usage at unlimited scale\" in the Engage section, but actual visual demonstrations of these features are absent from this homepage.\n\n**Conclusion:** The SimConverse homepage emphasizes research findings and institutional credibility rather than providing embedded product demonstrations or visual walkthroughs."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LaBSiewVueL6XPi1iZuL7Y","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"664712b2-1c12-4b43-adce-e1288802cf36","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:08:54.362Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción adyacentes"}
