{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011YY92w3vkkUVkcw94vYHYG","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"MagicSchool AI official YouTube channel demo video \"student rooms\" walkthrough\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"MagicSchool for Students (MagicStudent) Walkthrough with the Founder - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XEDrkZ43qR8\"},{\"title\":\"MagicSchool AI: MagicStudent Walkthrough - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WEfuXRv8P5M\"},{\"title\":\"MagicSchool AI Magic Minute: Setting up Learning Goals in Student Rooms - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RW82fq94OEM\"},{\"title\":\"MagicSchool AI Magic Minute: Setting Up Student Rooms - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ggICnrD9S0Y\"},{\"title\":\"Control Alt Achieve: \\\"Abracadabr-AI\\\" - MagicSchool AI Rooms for Student Learning\",\"url\":\"https://www.controlaltachieve.com/2025/01/abracadabr-ai-magicschool-ai-rooms-for.html\"},{\"title\":\"MagicSchool Academy | MagicSchool\",\"url\":\"https://www.magicschool.ai/magicschool-academy\"},{\"title\":\"MagicSchool AI Rooms for Student Learning\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ywpqV3h0QOE\"},{\"title\":\"AI Tool Demo: Building an Effective Tutor With MagicSchool AI | Edutopia\",\"url\":\"https://www.edutopia.org/video/ai-tool-demo-building-an-effective-tutor-with-magicschool-ai/\"},{\"title\":\"AI Training & Professional Development for Educators | MagicSchool\",\"url\":\"https://www.magicschool.ai/professional-development\"},{\"title\":\"Teacher-Led AI: How MagicSchool Student Rooms Give ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wdTdN49ASow\"}]\n\nI found several relevant results for MagicSchool AI's official YouTube channel with demo and walkthrough videos about student rooms:\n\n## Official YouTube Videos:\n\n1. **MagicSchool for Students (MagicStudent) Walkthrough with the Founder** (July 25, 2024)\n   - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XEDrkZ43qR8\n\n2. **MagicSchool AI: MagicStudent Walkthrough** (August 11, 2025)\n   - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WEfuXRv8P5M\n\n3. **Magic Minute: Setting Up Student Rooms - a series of quick, one-minute tips** (October 8, 2024)\n   - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ggICnrD9S0Y\n\n4. **Magic Minute: Setting up Learning Goals in Student Rooms** (October 22, 2025)\n   - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RW82fq94OEM\n\nThese videos provide walkthroughs on how to launch a student room in MagicSchool for students and demonstrate the features of their student-facing tools.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q2XBKnZToy495pRBT9n7Bd","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"7f1c931f-0f3a-4b7e-8183-f428a9507450","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:09:11.622Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción K12 genAI"}
