{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YNkWo1kjThA3GqXXe3mQDb","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"SimConverse webinar HealthySimulation video \"watch\" learner conversation AI patient\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"SimConverse | HealthySimulation.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.healthysimulation.com/simconverse-/\"},{\"title\":\"Leverage AI for Large Scale Healthcare Communication Skills Training | HealthySimulation.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.healthysimulation.com/webinars/simconverse-ai-clinical-communication-training/\"},{\"title\":\"SimConverse Utilizes AI to Improve Clinical Communication Skills Training | HealthySimulation.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.healthysimulation.com/simconverse-generative-ai-healthcare-simulation-communication-skills/\"},{\"title\":\"Increase Clinical Training Capacity with SimConverse’s Large-Scale Communication Platform | HealthySimulation.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.healthysimulation.com/simconverse-communication-skills-ai-training/\"},{\"title\":\"AI Healthcare Simulation is Already Here: But What’s It For? | HealthySimulation.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.healthysimulation.com/webinars/simconverse-clinical-communication-ai-training/\"},{\"title\":\"Top 25 Healthcare Simulation Webinars of 2024 | HealthySimulation.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.healthysimulation.com/top-25-healthcare-simulation-webinars-2024/\"},{\"title\":\"Leveraging Conversational AI to Train Better Healthcare Providers | HealthySimulation.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.healthysimulation.com/webinars/healthcare-simulation-conversational-ai/\"},{\"title\":\"SimConverse | LinkedIn\",\"url\":\"https://au.linkedin.com/company/simconverse\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found relevant information about SimConverse webinars hosted on HealthySimulation.com:\n\n## SimConverse Webinar Overview\n\nThere is a recorded webinar video with AI transcription available to watch on HealthySimulation.com about SimConverse's AI platform.\n\n## What SimConverse Is\n\nSimConverse is an Australian-based company with a medical simulation platform that uses generative AI to play the role of any patient or healthcare colleague for healthcare communications training. Using machine learning and Artificial Intelligence, SimConverse provides a multitude of simulated virtual patients complete with medical history, chief complaint, and physical examination findings.\n\n## Key Features for Learner Conversations\n\nWith the ability to verbally communicate directly via conversational speech with SimConverse, healthcare learners can ask clinical questions and receive accurate simulated patient responses immediately. Such functionality enables learners to practice robust clinical assessment interviews in real-time and provides for realistic decision-making practice that educators can evaluate.\n\nSimConverse offers a solution to the communication problem, with an ever-growing library of over 1000 AI characters with whom healthcare learners can practise their communication skills.\n\nThe webinars and resources are available on the HealthySimulation.com LEARN CE/CME platform.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LaBSiewVueL6XPi1iZuL7Y","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"c9c9adff-3fb2-477c-9398-0881739df155","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:09:16.774Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción adyacentes"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EHrbhRix5GgpT4jgMJbjVz","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"site:blog.duolingo.com \"screenshot\" lesson exercise app\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Bird’s Eye: A powerful tool for exploring app screenshots\",\"url\":\"https://blog.duolingo.com/birds-eye-a-powerful-tool-for-exploring-app-screenshots/\"},{\"title\":\"How dogfooding helps us build a better Duolingo\",\"url\":\"https://blog.duolingo.com/dogfooding-app/\"},{\"title\":\"guide to duolingo practice hub\",\"url\":\"https://blog.duolingo.com/ko/guide-to-duolingo-practice-hub\"},{\"title\":\"Duolingo is a website for the free\",\"url\":\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/duolingonpresentation/47491694\"},{\"title\":\"www.slideshare.net\",\"url\":\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/duolingo-website-tutorial/32362498\"},{\"title\":\"covering all the bases duolingos approach to speaking skills\",\"url\":\"https://blog.duolingo.com/covering-all-the-bases-duolingos-approach-to-speaking-skills\"},{\"title\":\"What is Duolingo?\",\"url\":\"https://teltales.port.ac.uk/tag/language/\"},{\"title\":\"A Comprehensive Review of DuoLingo\",\"url\":\"https://blogs.ncl.ac.uk/pdunne2/?p=46\"}]\n\nI found search results for your query on blog.duolingo.com. Here are the relevant findings:\n\nBird's Eye is an internal web application at Duolingo that allows viewing and filtering app screenshots across dozens of platforms, devices, and language combinations. While the majority of screenshots rendered in Bird's Eye are static screenshots, animated gifs are used to show how the app transitions from one screen to another.\n\nAdditionally, Duolingo releases a new version of its learning app every week for iOS, Android, and Web, with dozens of automated UI tests navigating through multiple scenarios in the app across 23 languages on 11 devices and web browsers.\n\nThe search also returned other Duolingo blog posts that reference screenshots of lesson exercises, including posts about the Practice Hub and speaking skills features that show various types of lesson activities and exercises within the app.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LaBSiewVueL6XPi1iZuL7Y","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"0a6ccc82-9da1-4ff8-a4bc-d0189ea58b2d","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:09:17.116Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción adyacentes"}
