{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MXrycE1BC2p84oJZk8TeJt","type":"tool_result","content":"# NotebookLM Public Sharing Feature\n\nThe page loads successfully and is a blog post announcement from Google about NotebookLM's new public sharing capability.\n\n## UI Elements Described\n\nThe article mentions functional elements but doesn't include screenshots or GIFs. It references:\n\n- A \"Share\" button \"in the top-right corner of your notebook\"\n- A sharing dialog where users can \"set the access to 'Anyone with a link'\"\n\n## Key Feature Details\n\nThe update enables users to \"share a notebook publicly with anyone using NotebookLM with a single link,\" allowing distribution of content like nonprofit project overviews, business manuals, or study guides.\n\n**Important limitation:** Viewers cannot edit source material but may \"interact with a public notebook by asking questions or exploring generated content, such as audio overviews, FAQs or briefing documents.\"\n\nAn August 1, 2025 update notes that public sharing currently applies only to personal accounts, with Workspace and Education sharing restricted to same-domain accounts."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TbUD4eAmf2AFiy49C3yZqP","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"ae148953-c830-412a-89b0-af9cb7d09954","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:09:20.254Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción Google/Khan"}
