{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B4WQco2zDYmwNpg6udwGLo","type":"tool_result","content":"# Amira Learning Help Center Page Analysis\n\nBased on the provided content, this page appears to be a **help center landing page that failed to load properly**. \n\nThe visible elements include:\n- A page header titled \"Product Help\"\n- A loading indicator\n- An error message stating \"CSS Error\"\n- A refresh button option\n- A cancel/close button\n\n**No article categories, tutorials, student experience guides, tutoring session walkthroughs, or assessment screenshots are displayed.** The page has encountered a technical issue preventing the help content from rendering. To access information about Amira's student interface, tutoring sessions, or assessment processes, the page would need to be refreshed or revisited once the CSS error is resolved."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q2XBKnZToy495pRBT9n7Bd","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"392b6086-b53b-4729-b70c-f89c1b552bd4","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:09:25.145Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción K12 genAI"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ga3RX7Lf13X29bqggExyfj","type":"tool_result","content":"# SchoolAI Demo Page Overview\n\nThis is a **form to request/book a demo** — not an interactive demo you can use without an account.\n\n## What's on the Page\n\nThe page features a prominent demo request form collecting:\n- Name and contact information\n- Organization details and country\n- Organization type (school/district/higher education)\n- How the user heard about SchoolAI\n- Marketing communication opt-in\n\n## Key Content\n\nBelow the form, SchoolAI outlines what their personalized demo will showcase:\n- Centralized AI platform management across districts\n- Safety parameters and teacher guardrails\n- Usage visibility across schools and classrooms\n- Student outcome improvements through personalized learning\n\n## Additional Elements\n\nThe page includes:\n- A direct contact option: \"Call or text +1 (801) 396-0051 Mon-Fri 8am-6pm MST\" or email sales@schoolai.com\n- A testimonial from a teacher noting \"Their grammar scores are improving, and their confidence is soaring\"\n- A statistic about \"28% boost in student critical thinking, ESSA Tier III validated\"\n\nThe page is designed to capture lead information and encourage scheduling a personalized demonstration with SchoolAI's sales team."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q2XBKnZToy495pRBT9n7Bd","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"16c316db-debf-49e7-b917-83b367fff1b1","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:09:25.748Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción K12 genAI"}
