{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ECJNcPV4qc4nE396jwpAo6","type":"tool_result","content":"# Duolingo Blog Post Analysis\n\n**Does it load?** Yes, the blog post content loads successfully.\n\n**Login required?** No indication of login requirements in the provided content.\n\n**Real screenshots present?** Yes, the post contains actual app UI screenshots alongside illustrations.\n\n## Images Listed:\n\n1. **Illustration** - \"Junior with his mouth open next to a speech bubble\" (decorative cover image)\n\n2. **Screenshot** - Speaking exercise showing \"Lin is next to a speech bubble that says 'Alice, are you Belgian?'\" with microphone button\n\n3. **Screenshot** - Dialogue exercise in French with three response options, each with microphone icons\n\n4. **Screenshot** - Character dialogue between Oscar and Lucy with French text and microphone control\n\n5. **Two Screenshots** - Translation exercises with microphone icons in text boxes (English sentences about opening times and horse riding)\n\n6. **Screenshot** - Korean course reading tab interface\n\n7. **Screenshot** - Korean course lesson from reading tab\n\n8. **Three iPhone Screens** - \"Video Call\" feature showing path node with video camera icon, calling interface, and active video call with character Lily\n\nThese images effectively demonstrate \"step-by-step\" speaking features, combining realistic app interfaces with illustrated characters throughout the post."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LaBSiewVueL6XPi1iZuL7Y","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"fd44b532-38e9-4107-b783-666752a9381e","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:09:28.837Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción adyacentes"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Bf5ar321nz2Z34W4E3BYVF","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"help.magicschool.ai article \"student room\" launch screenshots \"help.magicschool.ai/en/articles\"\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Control Alt Achieve: \\\"Abracadabr-AI\\\" - MagicSchool AI Rooms for Student Learning\",\"url\":\"https://www.controlaltachieve.com/2025/01/abracadabr-ai-magicschool-ai-rooms-for.html\"},{\"title\":\"MagicSchool - How to Launch a Student Room\",\"url\":\"https://www.iorad.com/player/2465678/MagicSchool---How-to-Launch-a-Student-Room\"},{\"title\":\"How to access Magicschool.ai - Boston Public Schools Office of Technology\",\"url\":\"https://bostonpublicschools.helpdocs.io/article/8iqhqcseub-magic-school-ai-for-teachers-and-students\"},{\"title\":\"AI Tools for K-12 Students & Learners | MagicSchool\",\"url\":\"https://www.magicschool.ai/magicstudent\"},{\"title\":\"New & Improved AI for Students | MagicSchool\",\"url\":\"https://www.magicschool.ai/blog-posts/new-magicstudent-experience\"},{\"title\":\"Access MagicSchool - howdoi\",\"url\":\"https://howdoi.riverdale.edu/wiki/Access_MagicSchool\"},{\"title\":\"AI Integrations for Schools and Districts | MagicSchool\",\"url\":\"https://www.magicschool.ai/integrations\"},{\"title\":\"MagicSchool AI FAQ | Safety, Pricing, Student Use & Privacy\",\"url\":\"https://www.magicschool.ai/faq\"},{\"title\":\"MagicSchool AI Magic Minute: Setting up a Student Room - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dgReVT3ddSs\"}]\n\nBased on my search results, I found information about MagicSchool AI's Student Room feature with launch instructions and screenshots, though the specific help.magicschool.ai article URL you mentioned wasn't directly returned. However, here's what I found:\n\nTo launch a Student Room in MagicSchool, you start by logging in to the MagicSchool website and clicking \"Launch to Students\" from the main screen, which brings up your \"Student Rooms\" page. Then you click \"Launch New Room\" to begin setting up a new student room.\n\nThis launches the \"Room Details\" screen, and after clicking \"Next,\" you're brought to the \"Select Tools for Your Students\" screen. You can hover above any tool and click \"Add\" to add it to your student room, and you can add as many tools as needed, including multiple copies of the same tool.\n\nAfter selecting tools, you proceed to the \"Customize Tools\" screen, where you can hover above tools and click \"Customize\" to customize them.\n\nThe search results also show that MagicSchool has introduced Starter Rooms—pre-built templates that help teachers quickly set up engaging student activities, and they've added quick \"Getting Started\" videos in the product to walk you through the process.\n\nIf you need to access the specific help article at help.magicschool.ai/en/articles, you may want to visit that URL directly or search within their help documentation.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q2XBKnZToy495pRBT9n7Bd","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"11d8becb-283a-408a-afb5-bac18fb0b100","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:09:29.624Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción K12 genAI"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FxrYnrZW8N57MUqVe7ABRq","type":"tool_result","content":"# Duolingo Blog Post Analysis\n\n**Load Status:** Yes, the page loads successfully.\n\n**Login Required:** No login is required to view this content.\n\n**Screenshots Assessment:** The post contains real app UI screenshots showing actual practice sessions and exercises in use.\n\n## Images Listed:\n\n1. **Duo with dumbbell** – Illustration (mascot character)\n2. **Practice tab interface** – Actual app screenshot showing menu options like \"Focused Listening, Speak, Listen, Mistakes, Stories, Radio, Words\"\n3. **Mistake review selection screen** – App screenshot displaying exercises to review\n4. **Mistake review lesson start** – App screenshot with Duo saying \"You'll review 10 mistakes in this practice set\"\n5. **Words practice prompt** – App screenshot inviting French vocabulary practice\n6. **Vocabulary matching exercise** – App screenshot of matching French-to-English words\n7. **Speaking exercise** – App screenshot showing \"Repeat after Lily\" with speech bubble\n8. **Listening exercise** – App screenshot with Lucy and waveform audio prompt\n\n**Conclusion:** This is a functional blog post featuring eight images—one illustration and seven genuine app interface screenshots demonstrating the Practice tab feature."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LaBSiewVueL6XPi1iZuL7Y","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"cb6e7840-4b9e-400c-8f7d-5fc94ff27e3c","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:09:29.884Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción adyacentes"}
