{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019VHYyKKjTmR55GQfHv2L8E","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"simconverse\" youtube.com watch demo OR walkthrough OR \"how it works\"\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"SimHub Walkthrough | Basic Software Overview for Sim Racers - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g3eoYjJj_9o\"},{\"title\":\"How to Watch Youtube and Plays Sims | TikTok\",\"url\":\"https://www.tiktok.com/discover/how-to-watch-youtube-and-plays-sims\"},{\"title\":\"Demo of the SimSpace Cyber Range Platform - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x-epkpKuFGY\"},{\"title\":\"Sim Control Hub - Demo - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ov_-kwuLC04\"},{\"title\":\"Simconverse | HealthySimulation.com\",\"url\":\"https://healthysimulation.com/simconverse\"},{\"title\":\"Boxville Demo walkthrough No Commentary - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jjtcwkTRUUw\"},{\"title\":\"How Blockchains Work: A Visual Walkthrough - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qLbUvqT-bNY\"},{\"title\":\"Modelsim/QuestaSim Simulator Walk Through (Tutorial For Beginners) Part-1 - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BNty-yTqYlA\"},{\"title\":\"MiSide DEMO | (No Commentary Gameplay) - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Eq_1cN4BdI4\"},{\"title\":\"Demo mode\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demo_mode\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found relevant information about SimConverse:\n\nSimConverse enables learners to reflect on previous patient encounters to further iterate the cycle of learning theory, to reflective practice, and finally, deliberative evaluation. \n\nThe power of SimConverse platform is the ability to adapt workflows based on the demonstrated needs of the learner as they progress through their healthcare education journey.\n\nNot limited to nursing, SimConverse has similar programs for medical schools, pharmacy programs, social work, and physical therapy learners to ensure that any learner can receive communication training.\n\nHowever, the search results did not return specific YouTube videos demonstrating or walking through SimConverse. The most relevant result was from HealthySimulation.com, which provides an overview of the platform's functionality and applications in healthcare education.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LaBSiewVueL6XPi1iZuL7Y","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"c7c1043b-86f1-4a6a-b61c-86816e078065","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:09:44.123Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción adyacentes"}
