{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MNn8TEdg1tPZyineU3kYCY","type":"tool_result","content":"# Analysis of Images in SchoolAI Blog Post\n\nBased on the provided web page content, **no real UI screenshots are included**. The page contains only:\n\n1. **Banner images** - Generic decorative graphics (books and beakers) promoting back-to-school features\n\n2. **Featured article image** - An illustration showing \"diverse young people represented as circular profile avatars scattered across a blue background\"\n\n3. **Related article thumbnails** - Stock photos accompanying linked blog posts about coaching and AI implementation\n\nThe blog post **describes** Mission Control dashboard functionality extensively—such as \"live mastery indicators\" and \"customizable alert filters\"—but provides no actual product screenshots. Similarly, it references Spaces as creating \"interactive lesson environments where student conversations with AI are captured,\" yet includes no visual demonstration of this feature.\n\nThe article relies entirely on narrative descriptions and real-world classroom scenarios rather than product interface imagery. This approach keeps focus on concepts and benefits while deferring visual product evidence to the demo or sign-up experience."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q2XBKnZToy495pRBT9n7Bd","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"89ff2161-aeaa-42a9-99b5-7205ea910849","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:09:50.866Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción K12 genAI"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0179H87GkPbgo1QG4EV8zoWG","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"SchoolAI official YouTube video demo Spaces student joins chat Mission Control teacher\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Video Explorer - SchoolAI Spaces – Personalized Tutors, Lessons, & Activities\",\"url\":\"https://schoolai.com/spaces/video-explorer\"},{\"title\":\"Give Every Student a Personalized Learning Experience | SchoolAI\",\"url\":\"https://schoolai.com/products/spaces\"},{\"title\":\"SchoolAI: AI Platform for K-12 Teachers and Students\",\"url\":\"https://tooldirectory.ai/tools/schoolai\"},{\"title\":\"The All-New Video Explorer | School AI Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://help.schoolai.com/en/articles/14658745-the-all-new-video-explorer\"},{\"title\":\"Create and use Spaces with the Space creator | School AI Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://help.schoolai.com/en/articles/10270295-create-and-use-spaces-with-the-space-creator\"},{\"title\":\"Getting Started with Spaces | School AI Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://help.schoolai.com/en/articles/15538519-getting-started-with-spaces\"},{\"title\":\"SchoolAI Review 2026: Student-Safe AI Chat Spaces\",\"url\":\"https://aitoolsbakery.com/blog/schoolai-review/\"},{\"title\":\"SchoolAI Review (2026): Safe AI Spaces for Students\",\"url\":\"https://www.aimadefor.com/blog/schoolai-review-teachers/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about SchoolAI's Spaces and Mission Control features, but the results don't contain a specific link to an official YouTube video demo with the exact scenario you mentioned (a student joining chat in Mission Control as a teacher).\n\nHere's what the search revealed about SchoolAI:\n\nTeachers design AI-powered learning experiences called Spaces — with content boundaries and behavior controls they set — and students work inside them with a personalized AI tutor. Teachers share the Space via a link, QR code, or through their LMS (like Google Classroom or Canvas), and students jump in on their own devices and start engaging immediately.\n\nMission Control — the teacher dashboard — gives teachers a live view of every student's session as it happens, showing engagement levels, learning progress, sentiment signals, and alerts if a student gets stuck or says something that needs attention.\n\nThe search results reference \"Get a demo\" buttons on SchoolAI's website, which suggests demo videos exist on their site, but the direct YouTube video link you're looking for wasn't returned in these results. You may want to check SchoolAI's official YouTube channel directly or visit their website at schoolai.com for the specific demo video.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q2XBKnZToy495pRBT9n7Bd","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"9d2c733c-db71-4cc4-b738-22e836c41d06","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:09:52.990Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción K12 genAI"}
