nshots across your help center.\n\n3. **Intercom Community Discussion**: Information about how the Intercom Help Center officially supports embedding Vimeo videos using the iframe tag.\n\n4. **SimConverse on Vimeo**: A showcase video of the SimConverse platform.\n\n5. **Intercom Help - Fin Vision**: A built-in capability that allows analyzing and understanding images sent by customers — including screenshots, photos, and images of documents — directly within conversations.\n\n6. **MemberVault Help Center**: Information about embedding videos from Vimeo, YouTube, and other platforms.\n\nThe search successfully found connections between SimConverse, Vimeo, Intercom, and help center support features, particularly related to screenshots and video embedding.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LaBSiewVueL6XPi1iZuL7Y","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"f28ee0b6-107f-408a-bd97-a4030be51dd9","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:10:03.067Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción adyacentes"}
