{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01R1mRXv2DibysaqFpzrzxVG","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Amira Learning video demo \"watch\" student reading session amiralearning.com resources OR blog OR vimeo\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Teacher Resource Hub | Implementation and Support\",\"url\":\"https://amiralearning.com/teacher-resource-hub/implementation-and-support\"},{\"title\":\"Amira Learning\",\"url\":\"https://amiralearning.com/\"},{\"title\":\"Amira Learning | Reading Assessment & Dyslexia Screener | HMH\",\"url\":\"https://www.hmhco.com/programs/amira\"},{\"title\":\"Reading Programs & Solutions for Schools | Amira\",\"url\":\"https://amiralearning.com/amira-reading-suite\"},{\"title\":\"Introducing Amira | The AI Learning Agent for Reading Growth | Videos & Movies on Vimeo\",\"url\":\"https://vimeo.com/1131705350\"},{\"title\":\"Meet Amira Learning | Your AI Learning Agent for Reading Growth - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5pGJXsavwL0\"},{\"title\":\"Amira Learning - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/@amira-learning\"},{\"title\":\"Founded Year\",\"url\":\"https://www.cbinsights.com/company/amira-learning\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about Amira Learning video resources:\n\nAmira offers videos and slide decks to introduce students to the program, including guidance on how to get started, videos showing what the program looks like at different grade levels, and model lessons that explain what students should know before they begin.\n\nThere are several video resources available:\n\n1. **Introduction Video**: A video to introduce students to Amira before they begin tutoring\n\n2. **Assessment Preparation Video**: A video to prepare students for a benchmark assessment\n\n3. **Vimeo**: I found a Vimeo video titled \"Introducing Amira | The AI Learning Agent for Reading Growth\" (https://vimeo.com/1131705350) that features an overview of Amira Learning's platform and includes testimonials from educators.\n\n4. **YouTube**: Amira Learning has a YouTube channel (https://www.youtube.com/@amira-learning) with videos about their platform, including \"Meet Amira Learning | Your AI Learning Agent for Reading Growth.\"\n\nThese resources include growth and projection charts for every student session, scored transcripts & recordings of Assess & Tutor sessions. You can access more resources through the Amira Learning teacher resource hub at amiralearning.com/teacher-resource-hub/implementation-and-support.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q2XBKnZToy495pRBT9n7Bd","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"6f8dba10-ecfe-436a-8991-e462d2f67b51","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:10:18.804Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción K12 genAI"}
