{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BrAskUSKxjtcxSshgqMSjf","type":"tool_result","content":"# Implementation and Support Page Content Summary\n\n## Main Resources Listed:\n\n**Videos & Webinars:**\n- \"Watch Webinar On Demand\" (video link placeholder noted but no actual URL provided)\n- Multiple How-To video walkthroughs via Storylane (interactive demos, not embedded videos)\n\n**Key Guides & PDFs:**\n- Implementation Guide\n- Summer School Guide\n- Launch Checklist\n- Benchmark Guide\n- MTSS Guide\n- Intervention Encyclopedia\n- Device Setup Guides (Chromebook, iPad, Windows)\n- Family Communication Guide\n\n**How-To Demonstrations (Storylane links):**\n- Configure Tutor Settings\n- View Tutor Time/Stories Read\n- Listen to a Recording\n- Assign an Assessment\n- View Assessment Results\n\n**Teacher Reports (with walkthroughs):**\n- Benchmark Report\n- Class Progress Report\n- Parent Report\n- Student Summary Report\n- Skills Diagnostic Report\n\n**Family Communication Materials:**\n- Amira Family Letter (10 languages)\n- Parent Report Overview\n- Amira at Home Handout\n- Tech Care Letter\n\n**Admin Resources:**\n- Admin Dashboard Setup Guide\n- Metrics Guide\n- Admin Observation Checklist\n\n**Note:** The page lists resources but does not contain embedded video URLs showing actual student reading sessions with Amira feedback. Interactive demonstrations are accessed via external Storylane platform links."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q2XBKnZToy495pRBT9n7Bd","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"534c29f0-92d0-493e-a5ad-162e90c73e24","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:10:38.977Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción K12 genAI"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ej9gcxAA7ZQDfUqiG5dzFL","type":"tool_result","content":"# Speak Blog Posts - Product Features\n\nHere are the blog posts most likely to contain app UI screenshots or videos:\n\n| Title | URL |\n|-------|-----|\n| \"Live Roleplays powered by OpenAI Realtime API\" | /blog/live-roleplays |\n| \"Speak Shares Details of AI Tutor, Built on Top of OpenAI's GPT-4\" | /blog/speak-gpt-4 |\n| \"How Speak reinvents language learning\" | /blog/how-speak-reinvents-language-learning |\n| \"Your most personalized Speak yet: What's new in our winter release\" | /blog/winter-2025 |\n| \"Leveling up our core speech recognition systems at Speak\" | /blog/asr-levelup |\n| \"Designing a High-Accuracy Speech Matching Pipeline with ASR and Phonetic Models\" | /blog/matching-v2 |\n| \"Building Speak's Voice Agent Platform\" | /blog/building-speaks-voice-agent-platform |\n\nThese posts focus on \"product features\" and \"updates,\" making them prime candidates for demonstrating interface design and interactive elements."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LaBSiewVueL6XPi1iZuL7Y","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"54cda168-ad45-4dd4-9bbf-0a7a3ca4f534","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:10:41.317Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción adyacentes"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XjxMV6X9yU94hU4sepxfpX","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"help.magicschool.ai/en/articles\" student room OR \"launch to students\"\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"MagicSchool - How to Launch a Student Room\",\"url\":\"https://www.iorad.com/player/2465678/MagicSchool---How-to-Launch-a-Student-Room\"},{\"title\":\"MagicSchool for AI Education: review, features & use cases\",\"url\":\"https://magicschool.en.softonic.com/web-apps\"},{\"title\":\"Control Alt Achieve: \\\"Abracadabr-AI\\\" - MagicSchool AI Rooms for Student Learning\",\"url\":\"https://www.controlaltachieve.com/2025/01/abracadabr-ai-magicschool-ai-rooms-for.html\"},{\"title\":\"MagicSchool for Students (MagicStudent) Walkthrough with the Founder\",\"url\":\"https://www.yeschat.ai/blog-magicschool-for-students-magicstudent-walkthrough-with-the-founder-53807\"},{\"title\":\"How to access Magicschool.ai - Boston Public Schools Office of Technology\",\"url\":\"https://bostonpublicschools.helpdocs.io/article/8iqhqcseub-magic-school-ai-for-teachers-and-students\"},{\"title\":\"Introduction to MagicSchool for Students\",\"url\":\"https://www.yeschat.ai/blog-Introduction-to-MagicSchool-for-Students-8021\"},{\"title\":\"AI Tools for K-12 Students & Learners | MagicSchool\",\"url\":\"https://www.magicschool.ai/magicstudent\"},{\"title\":\"AI Literacy for Students | MagicSchool\",\"url\":\"https://www.magicschool.ai/ai-literacy\"},{\"title\":\"New & Improved AI for Students | MagicSchool\",\"url\":\"https://www.magicschool.ai/blog-posts/new-magicstudent-experience\"},{\"title\":\"MagicSchool for Students (MagicStudent) Walkthrough with the Founder - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XEDrkZ43qR8\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about MagicSchool's Student Room and \"Launch to Students\" features:\n\n## Overview\n\nTo begin setting up a student room, click \"Launch to Students\" from the main MagicSchool screen.\n\n## What Student Rooms Are\n\nEducators can launch Student Rooms that their students can access specific features and tools that their educator has included for them to use. Educators can create school-safe student-friendly \"rooms\" with customized AI chatbots that students can interact with, including chatbots for writing feedback, idea generation, tutoring, sentence starters, character chats, and many more.\n\n## How to Set It Up\n\nThe first step is to open MagicSchool AI and click Launch to Students. Click Launch New Room. This will bring up the \"Select Tools for Your Students\" screen. Hover above any tool and click \"Add\" to add that tool to your student room. You can add as many tools as you want.\n\n## Monitoring and Access\n\nStudents can access MagicSchool.ai using the class join code, or URL link that is provided by the educator. Educators have the ability to view and monitor student output, comment on student work and pause or close student interaction with the tool.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q2XBKnZToy495pRBT9n7Bd","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"19a975eb-e172-4bc7-b45b-e176cdd185e8","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:10:43.634Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción K12 genAI"}
