{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DPe2a8guBiRyxDSJFVH6Ht","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"youtube.com\" SchoolAI demo video Spaces walkthrough teacher dashboard \"SchoolAI\" channel\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Video Explorer - SchoolAI Spaces – Personalized Tutors, Lessons, & Activities\",\"url\":\"https://schoolai.com/spaces/video-explorer\"},{\"title\":\"Getting Started with SchoolAI YouTube Summary - OpenTools\",\"url\":\"https://opentools.ai/youtube-summary/getting-started-with-schoolai\"},{\"title\":\"SchoolAI PowerUps | Ready-to-Use AI Tools for Teaching ...\",\"url\":\"https://schoolai.com/products/powerups\"},{\"title\":\"AI Tool Demo: Turning Passive Video Watching Into Active Learning With SchoolAI\",\"url\":\"https://www.edutopia.org/video/ai-tool-demo-turning-passive-video-watching-into-active-learning-with-schoolai/\"},{\"title\":\"Getting Started with Spaces | School AI Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://help.schoolai.com/en/articles/15538519-getting-started-with-spaces\"},{\"title\":\"SchoolAI — AI Built for Education\",\"url\":\"https://schoolai.com/\"},{\"title\":\"The All-New Video Explorer | School AI Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://help.schoolai.com/en/articles/14658745-the-all-new-video-explorer\"},{\"title\":\"Your First SchoolAI Space: What It Is, Why It’s Awesome, and How to Use It - AI for Teachers - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BJ8S-QzefaA&vl=en\"},{\"title\":\"Give Every Student a Personalized Learning Experience | SchoolAI\",\"url\":\"https://schoolai.com/products/spaces\"},{\"title\":\"AI Tool Demo: Turning Passive Video Watching into Active Learning with SchoolAI - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OmhK4Vv35KQ\"}]\n\nI found several relevant resources about SchoolAI demo videos and teacher dashboard features:\n\n## YouTube Videos Found:\n\n1. **\"Your First SchoolAI Space: What It Is, Why It's Awesome, and How to Use It\"** - A beginner-friendly session that guides you through using Spaces in any content area and grade level (uploaded July 10, 2025)\n\n2. **\"AI Tool Demo: Turning Passive Video Watching into Active Learning with SchoolAI\"** - An Edutopia demo video (from December 10, 2025) that shows how the platform works\n\n## Key Features Demonstrated:\n\n**SchoolAI Spaces:**\nSchoolAI Spaces let teachers design powerful, tailored learning experiences for every student, and helps them see what to do next.\n\n**Teacher Dashboard (Mission Control):**\nMission Control — your teacher dashboard — gives you a live view of every student's session as it happens. You'll see engagement levels, learning progress, sentiment signals, and alerts if a student gets stuck or says something that needs your attention.\n\n**Video Explorer Feature:**\nDrop a YouTube link into a Space, and your students will actively learn alongside Sidekick, pausing to check understanding along the way.\n\nThe search results include both official SchoolAI documentation and third-party educational resources demonstrating the platform's capabilities for teachers.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q2XBKnZToy495pRBT9n7Bd","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"d6638562-b900-47ab-8ea2-b3e29b66c395","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:11:34.474Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción K12 genAI"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CdvECAUDbGYBPrQ6NzScy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Investigación completada. Resultados verificados con WebFetch:\n\n**Duolingo**\n\nDuolingo | no-existe (demo-navegable) | https://www.duolingo.com/ | No hay deep link público verificable que entre directo a una lección como invitado: la web es una SPA y las URLs de lección solo devuelven el shell de la app sin contenido | — | WebFetch a https://www.duolingo.com/lesson/unit/1/level/1 devolvió solo el shell \"Duolingo\" sin lección; ninguna búsqueda arrojó URL estable de lección para invitados\n\nDuolingo | captura-en-soporte | https://blog.duolingo.com/covering-all-the-bases-duolingos-approach-to-speaking-skills | Capturas reales de ejercicios de habla en curso: ejercicio con botón de micrófono (\"Alice, are you Belgian?\"), diálogo en francés con 3 opciones de respuesta habladas, y 3 pantallas del Video Call con el personaje Lily en llamada activa | no | WebFetch confirmó que carga y enumeró ~10 imágenes distinguiendo capturas reales de UI vs ilustraciones\n\nDuolingo | captura-en-soporte | https://blog.duolingo.com/guide-to-duolingo-practice-hub/ | 7 capturas reales de la app en uso: pestaña Practice, repaso de errores (\"You'll review 10 mistakes\"), emparejamiento de vocabulario francés-inglés, ejercicio de habla \"Repeat after Lily\" y ejercicio de escucha con forma de onda | no | WebFetch confirmó carga sin login y listó las 8 imágenes (1 ilustración + 7 capturas genuinas de UI)\n\nNota: el post de Birdbrain (https://blog.duolingo.com/learning-how-to-help-you-learn-introducing-birdbrain/) carga pero contiene solo ilustraciones y diagramas, NO capturas de lección — no lo recomiendo. La URL what-is-birdbrain da 404.\n\n**Speak**\n\nSpeak | captura-en-soporte | https://www.speak.com/blog/live-roleplays | Post oficial (oct 2024) con vídeo embebido que introduce la experiencia Live Roleplays (roleplay de voz en tiempo real) más diagrama de arquitectura del Realtime API; es el único material del fabricante mostrando la interacción | no | WebFetch confirmó que carga sin login y que contiene un elemento `<video>` embebido y las imágenes descritas; no pude verificar los fotogramas del vídeo en sí\n\nSpeak | captura-en-soporte | https://www.speak.com/blog/winter-2025 | Mockups estilizados (no capturas crudas) de la UI: pantalla de lección de voz con el tutor, conversación de roleplay del \"AI Lesson revamp\" y Speak Score | no | WebFetch confirmó carga y las 8 imágenes; advirtió que son renders de marketing de la UI, no screenshots genuinos\n\nSpeak | no-existe (demo-navegable) | — | No existe demo web pública sin registro; la app requiere cuenta/descarga | — | Búsquedas y fetch del blog/home no muestran ningún enlace de demo navegable\n\n**SimConverse**\n\nSimConverse | video | https://vimeo.com/668418847 | \"SimConverse Showcase (2min)\": vídeo del propio fabricante mostrando la plataforma (\"Showcase of the SimConverse platform\") | no | Verificado vía API oEmbed de Vimeo: título \"SimConverse Showcase (2min)\", autor \"SimConverse\" (cuenta vimeo.com/user135202706), subido 2022-01-20; la página del vídeo pone captcha a bots pero el vídeo existe y es del fabricante. No pude confirmar fotogramas ni timestamps\n\nSimConverse | video | https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=emxyYTAktTc | Showcase de vendor de SimConverse en IMSH 2026 (canal de HealthySimulation, medio del sector, no del fabricante) | no | Verificado vía oEmbed de YouTube: título exacto \"SimConverse - IMSH 2026 Healthcare Simulation Vendor Showcase from HealthySimulation.com\", canal \"HealthySimulation - Medical Simulation Resources\"; contenido interno del vídeo no confirmable, sin timestamps\n\nSimConverse | no-existe (demo-navegable y captura-en-soporte) | https://www.simconverse.com/ | El sitio del fabricante NO enseña la interacción: home, /product/measure y /product/engage cargan sin login pero son solo texto + logos + \"Book a demo\"; cero screenshots y cero vídeos embebidos; /product/engage describe \"Feedback on conversations\" solo textualmente | — | WebFetch a las 3 páginas confirmó ausencia total de capturas/vídeos (única imagen: waves.svg decorativo); el help center público con capturas no aparece en búsquedas; healthysimulation.com devuelve 403 a fetch\n\nAlternativa académica para SimConverse (no verificada visualmente): el estudio JMIR Formative Research 2025 e71667 (https://formative.jmir.org/2025/1/e71667) evalúa SimConverse y podría contener figuras de la UI, pero el fetch devolvió contenido vacío y no pude confirmar sus figuras."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":655,"cache_read_input_tokens":48036,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":655,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LaBSiewVueL6XPi1iZuL7Y","session_id":"2c729f27-c1ad-49ef-a452-0b34c59ddecf","uuid":"a9c38c2d-3951-477a-9139-a35cf91c370e","timestamp":"2026-08-11T03:11:37.533Z","request_id":"req_011CdvEC7XrWwHRSk8j9zBx2","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Buscar URLs interacción adyacentes"}
